window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b041-005b6a04a33ed6b8.json"]={sha256:"005b6a04a33ed6b813711545713246af62cadcf2fe9322ac203768c18819a425",value:{"id":"b041","title":"橋梁轉體施工","titleEn":"Bridge rotation construction","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從平行於鐵路、道路或河道建造、再轉到跨越位置的工法邏輯出發，計算轉體重量、重心偏心與撐腳間隙，再處理球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩、下轉盤局部承壓、牽引系統、到位精調與封鉸，最後以稱重試驗、轉動監測與封固後的沉陷與淨空檢核驗收，並以比利時 Ben-Ahin 斜張橋、塞維亞 Barqueta 拱橋的浮力旋轉與石板坡鋼箱梁的轉向對照。","summaryEn":"Starting from the logic of building parallel to a railway, road or river and then swinging into the crossing position, compute rotating weight, centre-of-gravity eccentricity and support-leg gaps, then handle spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque, local bearing in the lower turntable, the traction system, final positioning and hinge encasement, and finally accept with a weighing test, rotation monitoring and post-encasement settlement and clearance checks, contrasting Belgium's Ben-Ahin cable-stayed bridge, the floating swing of Seville's Barqueta arch and the turning of the Shibanpo steel box.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-bridge-construction","subcategoryTitle":"橋梁施工工法與大型架設","subcategoryTitleEn":"Bridge construction methods and heavy erection","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-bridge-construction","learningTags":["structures","st-bridge-construction","segmental"],"architectureFamily":"segmental","architectureNodes":[["平行軸線預建上部結構","Superstructure built parallel"],["上轉盤與撐腳","Upper turntable and legs"],["球鉸與滑片","Spherical hinge and pads"],["下轉盤與樁基","Lower turntable and piles"],["牽引千斤頂與控制","Traction jacks and control"],["監測與封鉸","Monitoring and encasement"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[4,1],[5,1],[5,4]],"diagram":{"type":"segmental","labels":["平行軸線預建上部結構","上轉盤與撐腳","球鉸與滑片","下轉盤與樁基","牽引千斤頂與控制"],"labelsEn":["Superstructure built parallel","Upper turntable and legs","Spherical hinge and pads","Lower turntable and piles","Traction jacks and control"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計比較練習：轉體重 W = 150,000 kN，牽引半徑 4.5 m 由兩台千斤頂形成力偶，啟動靜摩擦 μ_s = 0.08、運行動摩擦 μ_d = 0.04，比較球鉸半徑 R = 2.0 m 與 2.5 m。R = 2.0 m：接觸應力 150,000/(π×2.0²) ≈ 11.9 MPa；啟動力矩 (2/3)×0.08×150,000×2.0 = 16,000 kN·m，每台千斤頂 16,000/(2×4.5) ≈ 1,778 kN；運行力矩 8,000 kN·m，每台約 889 kN。R = 2.5 m：接觸應力降為 150,000/(π×2.5²) ≈ 7.6 MPa（降低約 36%），但啟動力矩升為 20,000 kN·m，每台約 2,222 kN；運行力矩 10,000 kN·m，每台約 1,111 kN（增加 25%）。若 60 m 懸臂端轉動 70°（弧長約 73.3 m）且端點速度限 1.2 m/min，純轉動約 73.3/1.2 ≈ 61 min。結論：加大球鉸換來較低的接觸應力與較大的承壓餘裕，代價是牽引力與千斤頂規格提高，兩者需與封鎖時段及設備可用性一起權衡。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際橋梁的設計。","textEn":"Design comparison: rotating weight W = 150,000 kN, a 4.5 m traction radius with two jacks in a couple, static breakaway μ_s = 0.08 and running μ_d = 0.04, comparing hinge radii R = 2.0 m and 2.5 m. For R = 2.0 m the contact stress is 150,000/(π×2.0²) ≈ 11.9 MPa; the breakaway torque is (2/3)×0.08×150,000×2.0 = 16,000 kN·m, so each jack needs 16,000/(2×4.5) ≈ 1,778 kN; the running torque is 8,000 kN·m, about 889 kN per jack. For R = 2.5 m the contact stress falls to 150,000/(π×2.5²) ≈ 7.6 MPa, about 36% lower, but the breakaway torque rises to 20,000 kN·m, about 2,222 kN per jack, and the running torque to 10,000 kN·m, about 1,111 kN per jack, 25% more. Turning a 60 m tip through 70°, an arc of about 73.3 m, at a 1.2 m/min tip limit takes about 73.3/1.2 ≈ 61 min. Conclusion: a larger hinge buys lower contact stress and more bearing margin at the cost of higher traction and larger jacks, to be weighed together with the possession window and equipment availability. Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of any real bridge.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b041-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「轉體工法的系統與適用情境」與「轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"System logic and where rotation fits\" and \"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b041-v13-01","title":"轉體工法的系統與適用情境：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"System logic and where rotation fits: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「轉動 T 構與跨越線」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Rotating T-frame and the crossing line” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"轉體施工把橋梁上部結構先在不影響交通或河道的位置（通常平行於鐵路或河岸）以支架、懸臂或預製方式建好，再以橋墩頂或承台中的轉動中心旋轉到設計軸線。水平轉體最常見：一座平衡懸臂 T 構或斜張橋半跨坐在球鉸上，繞豎軸旋轉數十度；豎向轉體則把拱肋半跨先豎直或平躺建造，再繞拱腳的水平軸轉下或轉起；另有以浮箱支撐一端、繞另一端旋轉的浮運轉體。其核心價值是把跨越營運中鐵路或航道的高風險時段，壓縮成一次可控的數小時作業。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「轉動 T 構與跨越線」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Rotation construction builds the superstructure where it does not obstruct traffic or navigation, usually parallel to a railway or riverbank, by falsework, cantilevering or prefabrication, then swings it onto the design axis about a pivot in the pier top or pile cap. Horizontal rotation is most common: a balanced-cantilever T-frame or half of a cable-stayed bridge sits on a spherical hinge and turns tens of degrees about a vertical axis. Vertical rotation builds arch-rib halves upright or lying down and turns them about a horizontal axis at the springing; floating rotation supports one end on pontoons and pivots about the other. Its core value is compressing the high-risk period over a live railway or waterway into one controlled operation of a few hours. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Rotating T-frame and the crossing line” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：懸臂端半徑 r = 60 m、轉角 70° = 1.222 rad：端點弧長 s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a cantilever tip radius r = 60 m and a rotation of 70° = 1.222 rad, the tip travels s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「轉動 T 構與跨越線」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Rotating T-frame and the crossing line”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-01-k1","title":"轉體工法的系統與適用情境","titleEn":"System logic and where rotation fits","text":"轉體施工把橋梁上部結構先在不影響交通或河道的位置（通常平行於鐵路或河岸）以支架、懸臂或預製方式建好，再以橋墩頂或承台中的轉動中心旋轉到設計軸線。水平轉體最常見：一座平衡懸臂 T 構或斜張橋半跨坐在球鉸上，繞豎軸旋轉數十度；豎向轉體則把拱肋半跨先豎直或平躺建造，再繞拱腳的水平軸轉下或轉起；另有以浮箱支撐一端、繞另一端旋轉的浮運轉體。","textEn":"Rotation construction builds the superstructure where it does not obstruct traffic or navigation, usually parallel to a railway or riverbank, by falsework, cantilevering or prefabrication, then swings it onto the design axis about a pivot in the pier top or pile cap. Horizontal rotation is most common: a balanced-cantilever T-frame or half of a cable-stayed bridge sits on a spherical hinge and turns tens of degrees about a vertical axis.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉體工法的系統與適用情境」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System logic and where rotation fits\" is correct?","options":["轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。","轉體施工把橋梁上部結構先在不影響交通或河道的位置（通常平行於鐵路或河岸）以支架、懸臂或預製方式建好，再以橋墩頂或承台中的轉動中心旋轉到設計軸線。","對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。"],"optionsEn":["Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction.","Rotation construction builds the superstructure where it does not obstruct traffic or navigation, usually parallel to a railway or riverbank, by falsework, cantilevering or prefabrication, then swings it onto the design axis about a pivot in the pier top or pile cap.","A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast."],"answer":1,"explanation":"轉體施工把橋梁上部結構先在不影響交通或河道的位置（通常平行於鐵路或河岸）以支架、懸臂或預製方式建好，再以橋墩頂或承台中的轉動中心旋轉到設計軸線。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Rotation construction builds the superstructure where it does not obstruct traffic or navigation, usually parallel to a railway or riverbank, by falsework, cantilevering or prefabrication, then swings it onto the design axis about a pivot in the pier top or pile cap. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b041-v13-02","title":"轉體工法的系統與適用情境：定量估算","titleEn":"System logic and where rotation fits: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉動 T 構與跨越線」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Rotating T-frame and the crossing line” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：懸臂端半徑 r = 60 m、轉角 70° = 1.222 rad：端點弧長 s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m。若端點速度上限 1.5 m/min，純轉動時間約 73.3/1.5 ≈ 49 min，角速度 1.5/60 = 0.025 rad/min。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a cantilever tip radius r = 60 m and a rotation of 70° = 1.222 rad, the tip travels s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m. At a tip speed limit of 1.5 m/min, pure rotation takes about 73.3/1.5 ≈ 49 min, an angular speed of 1.5/60 = 0.025 rad/min. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：方案比選時以平面圖檢查轉動掃過的範圍：懸臂端與斜張索在整個轉動弧內不得碰觸電車線、號誌、既有建物或航道設施，並保留安全間距；同時以時程表確認轉動作業（含準備、試轉、轉動與精調）能放進業主核准的鐵路封鎖或交通管制時段。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: During option selection, check the swept area on plan: the cantilever tips and stays must clear catenary, signals, existing buildings and waterway facilities throughout the rotation arc with a safety margin, and a time schedule must show that preparation, trial turning, rotation and fine adjustment fit inside the railway possession or traffic closure approved by the owner.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"懸臂端半徑 r = 60 m、轉角 70° = 1.222 rad：端點弧長 s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m。若端點速度上限 1.5 m/min，純轉動時間約 73.3/1.5 ≈ 49 min，角速度 1.5/60 = 0.025 rad/min。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With a cantilever tip radius r = 60 m and a rotation of 70° = 1.222 rad, the tip travels s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m. At a tip speed limit of 1.5 m/min, pure rotation takes about 73.3/1.5 ≈ 49 min, an angular speed of 1.5/60 = 0.025 rad/min. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉體工法的系統與適用情境」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System logic and where rotation fits\", which statement holds?","options":["承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。","萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。","懸臂端半徑 r = 60 m、轉角 70° = 1.222 rad：端點弧長 s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m。"],"optionsEn":["A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load.","A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.","With a cantilever tip radius r = 60 m and a rotation of 70° = 1.222 rad, the tip travels s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"懸臂端半徑 r = 60 m、轉角 70° = 1.222 rad：端點弧長 s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a cantilever tip radius r = 60 m and a rotation of 70° = 1.222 rad, the tip travels s = r·θ = 60×1.222 ≈ 73.3 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b041-v13-03","title":"轉體工法的系統與適用情境：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"System logic and where rotation fits: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉動 T 構與跨越線」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rotating T-frame and the crossing line” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"方案比選時以平面圖檢查轉動掃過的範圍：懸臂端與斜張索在整個轉動弧內不得碰觸電車線、號誌、既有建物或航道設施，並保留安全間距；同時以時程表確認轉動作業（含準備、試轉、轉動與精調）能放進業主核准的鐵路封鎖或交通管制時段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"During option selection, check the swept area on plan: the cantilever tips and stays must clear catenary, signals, existing buildings and waterway facilities throughout the rotation arc with a safety margin, and a time schedule must show that preparation, trial turning, rotation and fine adjustment fit inside the railway possession or traffic closure approved by the owner. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：可行性研究階段就與鐵路或航道主管機關確認封鎖時段長度、轉動弧內的淨空要求與緊急恢復程序，並把這些條件寫入設計基準，而不是留給承包商在施工前才協調。","observationEn":"Site practice: At feasibility stage, agree possession length, clearances along the swept arc and emergency recovery procedures with the railway or waterway authority and write them into the design basis rather than leaving them to the contractor just before construction.","failure":"注意干擾：若規劃時只看起點與終點位置，忽略轉動弧線中段的淨空，懸臂端可能在轉動途中逼近電車線或鄰近結構，只能中途停止，讓結構停在既非施工位置也非設計位置的不利狀態。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Planning only the start and end positions and ignoring clearance along the middle of the arc can bring a tip close to catenary or a neighbouring structure mid-turn, forcing a stop that leaves the structure in neither its construction nor its design position. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"方案比選時以平面圖檢查轉動掃過的範圍：懸臂端與斜張索在整個轉動弧內不得碰觸電車線、號誌、既有建物或航道設施，並保留安全間距；同時以時程表確認轉動作業（含準備、試轉、轉動與精調）能放進業主核准的鐵路封鎖或交通管制時段。","textEn":"During option selection, check the swept area on plan: the cantilever tips and stays must clear catenary, signals, existing buildings and waterway facilities throughout the rotation arc with a safety margin, and a time schedule must show that preparation, trial turning, rotation and fine adjustment fit inside the railway possession or traffic closure approved by the owner.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"可行性研究階段就與鐵路或航道主管機關確認封鎖時段長度、轉動弧內的淨空要求與緊急恢復程序，並把這些條件寫入設計基準，而不是留給承包商在施工前才協調。","textEn":"At feasibility stage, agree possession length, clearances along the swept arc and emergency recovery procedures with the railway or waterway authority and write them into the design basis rather than leaving them to the contractor just before construction.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉體工法的系統與適用情境」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System logic and where rotation fits\"?","options":["方案比選時以平面圖檢查轉動掃過的範圍：懸臂端與斜張索在整個轉動弧內不得碰觸電車線、號誌、既有建物或航道設施，並保留安全間距。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。"],"optionsEn":["During option selection, check the swept area on plan: the cantilever tips and stays must clear catenary, signals, existing buildings and waterway facilities throughout the rotation arc with a safety margin, and a time schedule must show that preparation, trial turning, rotation and fine adjustment fit inside the railway possession or traffic closure approved by the owner.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival."],"answer":0,"explanation":"方案比選時以平面圖檢查轉動掃過的範圍：懸臂端與斜張索在整個轉動弧內不得碰觸電車線、號誌、既有建物或航道設施，並保留安全間距；同時以時程表確認轉動作業（含準備、試轉、轉動與精調）能放進業主核准的鐵路封鎖或交通管制時段。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"During option selection, check the swept area on plan: the cantilever tips and stays must clear catenary, signals, existing buildings and waterway facilities throughout the rotation arc with a safety margin, and a time schedule must show that preparation, trial turning, rotation and fine adjustment fit inside the railway possession or traffic closure approved by the owner. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b041-v13-04","title":"轉體工法的系統與適用情境：失效診斷","titleEn":"System logic and where rotation fits: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉動 T 構與跨越線」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rotating T-frame and the crossing line” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若規劃時只看起點與終點位置，忽略轉動弧線中段的淨空，懸臂端可能在轉動途中逼近電車線或鄰近結構，只能中途停止，讓結構停在既非施工位置也非設計位置的不利狀態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Planning only the start and end positions and ignoring clearance along the middle of the arc can bring a tip close to catenary or a neighbouring structure mid-turn, forcing a stop that leaves the structure in neither its construction nor its design position. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：其核心價值是把跨越營運中鐵路或航道的高風險時段，壓縮成一次可控的數小時作業。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Its core value is compressing the high-risk period over a live railway or waterway into one controlled operation of a few hours.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若規劃時只看起點與終點位置，忽略轉動弧線中段的淨空，懸臂端可能在轉動途中逼近電車線或鄰近結構，只能中途停止，讓結構停在既非施工位置也非設計位置的不利狀態。","textEn":"Planning only the start and end positions and ignoring clearance along the middle of the arc can bring a tip close to catenary or a neighbouring structure mid-turn, forcing a stop that leaves the structure in neither its construction nor its design position.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉體工法的系統與適用情境」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System logic and where rotation fits\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若規劃時只看起點與終點位置，忽略轉動弧線中段的淨空，懸臂端可能在轉動途中逼近電車線或鄰近結構，只能中途停止，讓結構停在既非施工位置也非設計位置的不利狀態。","對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Planning only the start and end positions and ignoring clearance along the middle of the arc can bring a tip close to catenary or a neighbouring structure mid-turn, forcing a stop that leaves the structure in neither its construction nor its design position.","A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若規劃時只看起點與終點位置，忽略轉動弧線中段的淨空，懸臂端可能在轉動途中逼近電車線或鄰近結構，只能中途停止，讓結構停在既非施工位置也非設計位置的不利狀態。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Planning only the start and end positions and ignoring clearance along the middle of the arc can bring a tip close to catenary or a neighbouring structure mid-turn, forcing a stop that leaves the structure in neither its construction nor its design position. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b041-v13-05","title":"轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「轉體重心偏心」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Centre-of-gravity eccentricity” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"水平轉體時，整個上部結構與上轉盤只靠中心球鉸承重，周圍一圈撐腳與環形滑道保持數公釐到數十公釐的間隙，只在結構傾斜時接觸，作為防傾的保險。理論上兩側懸臂重量相等，但混凝土實際密度、斷面尺寸、預力與施工殘留物都會造成重心偏離球鉸中心，形成不平衡力矩。若不平衡力矩過大，撐腳會壓在滑道上摩擦，使牽引力暴增；因此設計常要求先量出偏心，再以配重調整，或刻意保留很小的縱向偏心，使結構穩定地以球鉸加一側撐腳轉動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「轉體重心偏心」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In horizontal rotation the whole superstructure and upper turntable rest only on the central spherical hinge, while a ring of support legs keeps a gap of a few to tens of millimetres above an annular slideway and touches it only if the structure tilts, as an anti-overturning safeguard. In theory the two cantilevers weigh the same, but actual concrete density, section sizes, prestress and construction leftovers shift the centre of gravity off the hinge, creating an unbalanced moment. If it is large, legs bear on the slideway and friction greatly increases the traction needed, so designs usually require the eccentricity to be measured and corrected with ballast, or a very small longitudinal eccentricity kept on purpose so the structure turns steadily on the hinge plus one leg pair. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Centre-of-gravity eccentricity” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：轉體重 W = 150,000 kN、重心偏心 e = 0.05 m：不平衡力矩 M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m；若由半徑 4.0 m 的撐腳承擔，撐腳力 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a rotating weight W = 150,000 kN and centre-of-gravity eccentricity e = 0.05 m, the unbalanced moment M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m; carried by legs at 4.0 m radius, the leg force is 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「轉體重心偏心」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Centre-of-gravity eccentricity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-05-k1","title":"轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡","titleEn":"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance","text":"水平轉體時，整個上部結構與上轉盤只靠中心球鉸承重，周圍一圈撐腳與環形滑道保持數公釐到數十公釐的間隙，只在結構傾斜時接觸，作為防傾的保險。理論上兩側懸臂重量相等，但混凝土實際密度、斷面尺寸、預力與施工殘留物都會造成重心偏離球鉸中心，形成不平衡力矩。","textEn":"In horizontal rotation the whole superstructure and upper turntable rest only on the central spherical hinge, while a ring of support legs keeps a gap of a few to tens of millimetres above an annular slideway and touches it only if the structure tilts, as an anti-overturning safeguard. In theory the two cantilevers weigh the same, but actual concrete density, section sizes, prestress and construction leftovers shift the centre of gravity off the hinge, creating an unbalanced moment.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance\" is correct?","options":["對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。","球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。","水平轉體時，整個上部結構與上轉盤只靠中心球鉸承重，周圍一圈撐腳與環形滑道保持數公釐到數十公釐的間隙，只在結構傾斜時接觸，作為防傾的保險。"],"optionsEn":["A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast.","A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.","In horizontal rotation the whole superstructure and upper turntable rest only on the central spherical hinge, while a ring of support legs keeps a gap of a few to tens of millimetres above an annular slideway and touches it only if the structure tilts, as an anti-overturning safeguard."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水平轉體時，整個上部結構與上轉盤只靠中心球鉸承重，周圍一圈撐腳與環形滑道保持數公釐到數十公釐的間隙，只在結構傾斜時接觸，作為防傾的保險。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In horizontal rotation the whole superstructure and upper turntable rest only on the central spherical hinge, while a ring of support legs keeps a gap of a few to tens of millimetres above an annular slideway and touches it only if the structure tilts, as an anti-overturning safeguard. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b041-v13-06","title":"轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡：定量估算","titleEn":"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉體重心偏心」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Centre-of-gravity eccentricity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：轉體重 W = 150,000 kN、重心偏心 e = 0.05 m：不平衡力矩 M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m；若由半徑 4.0 m 的撐腳承擔，撐腳力 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN。撐腳間隙 10 mm、撐腳半徑 4.5 m 時，傾角上限 0.010/4.5 ≈ 0.0022 rad，對應 60 m 懸臂端豎向位移約 133 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a rotating weight W = 150,000 kN and centre-of-gravity eccentricity e = 0.05 m, the unbalanced moment M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m; carried by legs at 4.0 m radius, the leg force is 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN. With a 10 mm leg gap at 4.5 m radius, tilt is limited to 0.010/4.5 ≈ 0.0022 rad, about 133 mm vertical movement at a 60 m tip. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以施工紀錄（實測混凝土單位重、斷面尺寸、預力與附屬物）重新計算重心，並與稱重試驗結果比較；撐腳與滑道的間隙在轉動前逐點量測並記錄，任何一點間隙為零或過大都要查明原因。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Recalculate the centre of gravity from construction records (measured concrete unit weight, section dimensions, prestress and attachments) and compare with the weighing test; measure and record the gap at every leg before rotation, investigating any leg with zero or excessive gap.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"轉體重 W = 150,000 kN、重心偏心 e = 0.05 m：不平衡力矩 M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m；若由半徑 4.0 m 的撐腳承擔，撐腳力 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN。撐腳間隙 10 mm、撐腳半徑 4.5 m 時，傾角上限 0.010/4.5 ≈ 0.0022 rad，對應 60 m 懸臂端豎向位移約 133 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"For a rotating weight W = 150,000 kN and centre-of-gravity eccentricity e = 0.05 m, the unbalanced moment M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m; carried by legs at 4.0 m radius, the leg force is 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN. With a 10 mm leg gap at 4.5 m radius, tilt is limited to 0.010/4.5 ≈ 0.0022 rad, about 133 mm vertical movement at a 60 m tip. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance\", which statement holds?","options":["轉體重 W = 150,000 kN、重心偏心 e = 0.05 m：不平衡力矩 M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m。","牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。","球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。"],"optionsEn":["For a rotating weight W = 150,000 kN and centre-of-gravity eccentricity e = 0.05 m, the unbalanced moment M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m.","Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control.","The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"轉體重 W = 150,000 kN、重心偏心 e = 0.05 m：不平衡力矩 M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m；若由半徑 4.0 m 的撐腳承擔，撐腳力 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a rotating weight W = 150,000 kN and centre-of-gravity eccentricity e = 0.05 m, the unbalanced moment M = W·e = 7,500 kN·m; carried by legs at 4.0 m radius, the leg force is 7,500/4.0 = 1,875 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b041-v13-07","title":"轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉體重心偏心」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Centre-of-gravity eccentricity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以施工紀錄（實測混凝土單位重、斷面尺寸、預力與附屬物）重新計算重心，並與稱重試驗結果比較；撐腳與滑道的間隙在轉動前逐點量測並記錄，任何一點間隙為零或過大都要查明原因。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Recalculate the centre of gravity from construction records (measured concrete unit weight, section dimensions, prestress and attachments) and compare with the weighing test; measure and record the gap at every leg before rotation, investigating any leg with zero or excessive gap. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：施工中持續累計兩側懸臂的實際重量（含預力、護欄預埋件與殘留模板），並在設計文件中訂明容許偏心與配重調整程序；配重的重量與位置由設計單位核定。","observationEn":"Site practice: Keep a running tally of the actual weight of each cantilever during construction, including prestress, barrier embedments and leftover formwork, and state the allowable eccentricity and ballast procedure in the design documents; ballast weight and position are approved by the designer.","failure":"注意干擾：未量測偏心就轉動，撐腳在滑道上一路摩擦，牽引力超過千斤頂容量而卡在半途；偏心更大時結構傾斜到撐腳承壓，滑道局部壓碎，懸臂端下沉侵入下方鐵路淨空。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Rotating without measuring eccentricity lets legs scrape along the slideway so traction exceeds jack capacity and the turn stalls halfway; larger eccentricity tilts the structure onto its legs, crushing the slideway locally and dropping a tip into the railway clearance below. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以施工紀錄（實測混凝土單位重、斷面尺寸、預力與附屬物）重新計算重心，並與稱重試驗結果比較；撐腳與滑道的間隙在轉動前逐點量測並記錄，任何一點間隙為零或過大都要查明原因。","textEn":"Recalculate the centre of gravity from construction records (measured concrete unit weight, section dimensions, prestress and attachments) and compare with the weighing test; measure and record the gap at every leg before rotation, investigating any leg with zero or excessive gap.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"施工中持續累計兩側懸臂的實際重量（含預力、護欄預埋件與殘留模板），並在設計文件中訂明容許偏心與配重調整程序；配重的重量與位置由設計單位核定。","textEn":"Keep a running tally of the actual weight of each cantilever during construction, including prestress, barrier embedments and leftover formwork, and state the allowable eccentricity and ballast procedure in the design documents; ballast weight and position are approved by the designer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以施工紀錄（實測混凝土單位重、斷面尺寸、預力與附屬物）重新計算重心，並與稱重試驗結果比較。","封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Recalculate the centre of gravity from construction records (measured concrete unit weight, section dimensions, prestress and attachments) and compare with the weighing test.","Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以施工紀錄（實測混凝土單位重、斷面尺寸、預力與附屬物）重新計算重心，並與稱重試驗結果比較；撐腳與滑道的間隙在轉動前逐點量測並記錄，任何一點間隙為零或過大都要查明原因。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Recalculate the centre of gravity from construction records (measured concrete unit weight, section dimensions, prestress and attachments) and compare with the weighing test; measure and record the gap at every leg before rotation, investigating any leg with zero or excessive gap. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b041-v13-08","title":"轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉體重心偏心」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Centre-of-gravity eccentricity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"未量測偏心就轉動，撐腳在滑道上一路摩擦，牽引力超過千斤頂容量而卡在半途；偏心更大時結構傾斜到撐腳承壓，滑道局部壓碎，懸臂端下沉侵入下方鐵路淨空。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Rotating without measuring eccentricity lets legs scrape along the slideway so traction exceeds jack capacity and the turn stalls halfway; larger eccentricity tilts the structure onto its legs, crushing the slideway locally and dropping a tip into the railway clearance below. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若不平衡力矩過大，撐腳會壓在滑道上摩擦，使牽引力暴增；因此設計常要求先量出偏心，再以配重調整，或刻意保留很小的縱向偏心，使結構穩定地以球鉸加一側撐腳轉動。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If it is large, legs bear on the slideway and friction greatly increases the traction needed, so designs usually require the eccentricity to be measured and corrected with ballast, or a very small longitudinal eccentricity kept on purpose so the structure turns steadily on the hinge plus one leg pair.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"未量測偏心就轉動，撐腳在滑道上一路摩擦，牽引力超過千斤頂容量而卡在半途；偏心更大時結構傾斜到撐腳承壓，滑道局部壓碎，懸臂端下沉侵入下方鐵路淨空。","textEn":"Rotating without measuring eccentricity lets legs scrape along the slideway so traction exceeds jack capacity and the turn stalls halfway; larger eccentricity tilts the structure onto its legs, crushing the slideway locally and dropping a tip into the railway clearance below.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉體重量、重心與撐腳平衡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Rotating weight, centre of gravity and leg balance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。","未量測偏心就轉動，撐腳在滑道上一路摩擦，牽引力超過千斤頂容量而卡在半途；偏心更大時結構傾斜到撐腳承壓，滑道局部壓碎，懸臂端下沉侵入下方鐵路淨空。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.","Rotating without measuring eccentricity lets legs scrape along the slideway so traction exceeds jack capacity and the turn stalls halfway."],"answer":2,"explanation":"未量測偏心就轉動，撐腳在滑道上一路摩擦，牽引力超過千斤頂容量而卡在半途；偏心更大時結構傾斜到撐腳承壓，滑道局部壓碎，懸臂端下沉侵入下方鐵路淨空。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Rotating without measuring eccentricity lets legs scrape along the slideway so traction exceeds jack capacity and the turn stalls halfway; larger eccentricity tilts the structure onto its legs, crushing the slideway locally and dropping a tip into the railway clearance below. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b041-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩」與「上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque\" and \"Turntables, support legs and slideway details\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b041-v13-09","title":"球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「球鉸與聚四氟乙烯滑片」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Spherical hinge and PTFE pads” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"球鉸由上下兩片球面鋼板組成：下球面板固定在下轉盤，上球面板固定在上轉盤，兩者之間嵌入聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）滑片並塗抹潤滑脂。球面讓結構在豎直力作用下自動對中，也允許少量傾斜；滑片把接觸應力限制在材料容許範圍，並提供低而穩定的摩擦。轉動時的阻力主要是球鉸摩擦力矩，它與總重、摩擦係數與球鉸半徑成正比，所以球鉸做得越大，接觸應力越低，但摩擦力矩反而越大，這是球鉸尺寸設計的核心取捨。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「球鉸與聚四氟乙烯滑片」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A spherical hinge consists of two spherical steel plates: the lower one fixed in the lower turntable and the upper one in the upper turntable, with greased PTFE pads inset between them. The spherical shape self-centres the structure under vertical load and permits a little tilt, while the pads keep contact stress within material limits and give low, stable friction. Rotation resistance is mainly the hinge friction torque, proportional to total weight, friction coefficient and hinge radius; a larger hinge lowers contact stress but raises friction torque, the central trade-off in sizing the hinge. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Spherical hinge and PTFE pads” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：球鉸投影半徑 R = 2.0 m：面積 π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m²，W = 150,000 kN 時平均接觸應力 σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a projected hinge radius R = 2.0 m, the area is π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m² and the average contact stress for W = 150,000 kN is σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「球鉸與聚四氟乙烯滑片」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Spherical hinge and PTFE pads”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-09-k1","title":"球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩","titleEn":"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque","text":"球鉸由上下兩片球面鋼板組成：下球面板固定在下轉盤，上球面板固定在上轉盤，兩者之間嵌入聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）滑片並塗抹潤滑脂。球面讓結構在豎直力作用下自動對中，也允許少量傾斜；滑片把接觸應力限制在材料容許範圍，並提供低而穩定的摩擦。","textEn":"A spherical hinge consists of two spherical steel plates: the lower one fixed in the lower turntable and the upper one in the upper turntable, with greased PTFE pads inset between them. The spherical shape self-centres the structure under vertical load and permits a little tilt, while the pads keep contact stress within material limits and give low, stable friction.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque\" is correct?","options":["球鉸由上下兩片球面鋼板組成：下球面板固定在下轉盤，上球面板固定在上轉盤，兩者之間嵌入聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）滑片並塗抹潤滑脂。","球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。","承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。"],"optionsEn":["A spherical hinge consists of two spherical steel plates: the lower one fixed in the lower turntable and the upper one in the upper turntable, with greased PTFE pads inset between them.","A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.","A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load."],"answer":0,"explanation":"球鉸由上下兩片球面鋼板組成：下球面板固定在下轉盤，上球面板固定在上轉盤，兩者之間嵌入聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）滑片並塗抹潤滑脂。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A spherical hinge consists of two spherical steel plates: the lower one fixed in the lower turntable and the upper one in the upper turntable, with greased PTFE pads inset between them. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b041-v13-10","title":"球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩：定量估算","titleEn":"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「球鉸與聚四氟乙烯滑片」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Spherical hinge and PTFE pads” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：球鉸投影半徑 R = 2.0 m：面積 π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m²，W = 150,000 kN 時平均接觸應力 σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa。以均布壓力近似，摩擦力矩 M_f = (2/3)·μ·W·R；設計摩擦 μ = 0.06 時 M_f = (2/3)×0.06×150,000×2.0 = 12,000 kN·m。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a projected hinge radius R = 2.0 m, the area is π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m² and the average contact stress for W = 150,000 kN is σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa. Approximating uniform pressure, the friction torque is M_f = (2/3)·μ·W·R; with a design friction μ = 0.06, M_f = (2/3)×0.06×150,000×2.0 = 12,000 kN·m. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：球鉸在工廠完成後量測球面曲率半徑、表面粗糙度與滑片嵌入深度，並做組合試驗；現場安裝時以精密水準確認下球面板水平度與中心位置，澆置下轉盤混凝土時防止球面板浮動或變形，完成後再複測。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After shop fabrication, measure the sphere radius, surface roughness and pad recess depth and carry out an assembly check; on site, verify the levelness and centre of the lower plate by precise levelling, prevent it floating or distorting while the lower turntable is cast, and re-survey afterwards.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"球鉸投影半徑 R = 2.0 m：面積 π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m²，W = 150,000 kN 時平均接觸應力 σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa。以均布壓力近似，摩擦力矩 M_f = (2/3)·μ·W·R；設計摩擦 μ = 0.06 時 M_f = (2/3)×0.06×150,000×2.0 = 12,000 kN·m。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With a projected hinge radius R = 2.0 m, the area is π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m² and the average contact stress for W = 150,000 kN is σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa. Approximating uniform pressure, the friction torque is M_f = (2/3)·μ·W·R; with a design friction μ = 0.06, M_f = (2/3)×0.06×150,000×2.0 = 12,000 kN·m. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque\", which statement holds?","options":["萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。","球鉸投影半徑 R = 2.0 m：面積 π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m²，W = 150,000 kN 時平均接觸應力 σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa。","轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。"],"optionsEn":["A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.","With a projected hinge radius R = 2.0 m, the area is π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m² and the average contact stress for W = 150,000 kN is σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa.","Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival."],"answer":1,"explanation":"球鉸投影半徑 R = 2.0 m：面積 π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m²，W = 150,000 kN 時平均接觸應力 σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a projected hinge radius R = 2.0 m, the area is π×2.0² ≈ 12.57 m² and the average contact stress for W = 150,000 kN is σ ≈ 150,000/12.57 ≈ 11.9 MPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b041-v13-11","title":"球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「球鉸與聚四氟乙烯滑片」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Spherical hinge and PTFE pads” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"球鉸在工廠完成後量測球面曲率半徑、表面粗糙度與滑片嵌入深度，並做組合試驗；現場安裝時以精密水準確認下球面板水平度與中心位置，澆置下轉盤混凝土時防止球面板浮動或變形，完成後再複測。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After shop fabrication, measure the sphere radius, surface roughness and pad recess depth and carry out an assembly check; on site, verify the levelness and centre of the lower plate by precise levelling, prevent it floating or distorting while the lower turntable is cast, and re-survey afterwards. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：球鉸的製造、運輸、安裝與保護（防塵、防雨、防焊渣）應有專屬程序，安裝完成至轉動前以保護罩覆蓋；滑片材料與潤滑脂須有出廠檢驗與摩擦試驗報告。","observationEn":"Site practice: Hinge fabrication, transport, installation and protection from dust, rain and weld spatter need a dedicated procedure, with a protective cover from installation until rotation; pad material and grease require mill certificates and friction test reports.","failure":"注意干擾：下球面板在澆置時偏移或傾斜，上下球面無法密貼，接觸集中在局部，滑片被擠出或磨損，摩擦力矩遠大於設計值；潤滑脂混入砂土同樣會使摩擦暴增，轉動時出現停頓跳動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If the lower plate shifts or tilts during casting, the spheres do not seat, contact concentrates locally, pads extrude or wear and friction torque far exceeds design; grease contaminated with sand also sharply raises friction, causing stick-slip jumps during rotation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"球鉸在工廠完成後量測球面曲率半徑、表面粗糙度與滑片嵌入深度，並做組合試驗；現場安裝時以精密水準確認下球面板水平度與中心位置，澆置下轉盤混凝土時防止球面板浮動或變形，完成後再複測。","textEn":"After shop fabrication, measure the sphere radius, surface roughness and pad recess depth and carry out an assembly check; on site, verify the levelness and centre of the lower plate by precise levelling, prevent it floating or distorting while the lower turntable is cast, and re-survey afterwards.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"球鉸的製造、運輸、安裝與保護（防塵、防雨、防焊渣）應有專屬程序，安裝完成至轉動前以保護罩覆蓋；滑片材料與潤滑脂須有出廠檢驗與摩擦試驗報告。","textEn":"Hinge fabrication, transport, installation and protection from dust, rain and weld spatter need a dedicated procedure, with a protective cover from installation until rotation; pad material and grease require mill certificates and friction test reports.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。","球鉸在工廠完成後量測球面曲率半徑、表面粗糙度與滑片嵌入深度，並做組合試驗。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion.","After shop fabrication, measure the sphere radius, surface roughness and pad recess depth and carry out an assembly check."],"answer":2,"explanation":"球鉸在工廠完成後量測球面曲率半徑、表面粗糙度與滑片嵌入深度，並做組合試驗；現場安裝時以精密水準確認下球面板水平度與中心位置，澆置下轉盤混凝土時防止球面板浮動或變形，完成後再複測。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"After shop fabrication, measure the sphere radius, surface roughness and pad recess depth and carry out an assembly check; on site, verify the levelness and centre of the lower plate by precise levelling, prevent it floating or distorting while the lower turntable is cast, and re-survey afterwards. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b041-v13-12","title":"球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩：失效診斷","titleEn":"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「球鉸與聚四氟乙烯滑片」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Spherical hinge and PTFE pads” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"下球面板在澆置時偏移或傾斜，上下球面無法密貼，接觸集中在局部，滑片被擠出或磨損，摩擦力矩遠大於設計值；潤滑脂混入砂土同樣會使摩擦暴增，轉動時出現停頓跳動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If the lower plate shifts or tilts during casting, the spheres do not seat, contact concentrates locally, pads extrude or wear and friction torque far exceeds design; grease contaminated with sand also sharply raises friction, causing stick-slip jumps during rotation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：轉動時的阻力主要是球鉸摩擦力矩，它與總重、摩擦係數與球鉸半徑成正比，所以球鉸做得越大，接觸應力越低，但摩擦力矩反而越大，這是球鉸尺寸設計的核心取捨。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Rotation resistance is mainly the hinge friction torque, proportional to total weight, friction coefficient and hinge radius; a larger hinge lowers contact stress but raises friction torque, the central trade-off in sizing the hinge.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"下球面板在澆置時偏移或傾斜，上下球面無法密貼，接觸集中在局部，滑片被擠出或磨損，摩擦力矩遠大於設計值；潤滑脂混入砂土同樣會使摩擦暴增，轉動時出現停頓跳動。","textEn":"If the lower plate shifts or tilts during casting, the spheres do not seat, contact concentrates locally, pads extrude or wear and friction torque far exceeds design; grease contaminated with sand also sharply raises friction, causing stick-slip jumps during rotation.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「球鉸接觸應力與摩擦力矩」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Spherical-hinge contact stress and friction torque\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["下球面板在澆置時偏移或傾斜，上下球面無法密貼，接觸集中在局部，滑片被擠出或磨損，摩擦力矩遠大於設計值；潤滑脂混入砂土同樣會使摩擦暴增，轉動時出現停頓跳動。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。"],"optionsEn":["If the lower plate shifts or tilts during casting, the spheres do not seat, contact concentrates locally, pads extrude or wear and friction torque far exceeds design.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load."],"answer":0,"explanation":"下球面板在澆置時偏移或傾斜，上下球面無法密貼，接觸集中在局部，滑片被擠出或磨損，摩擦力矩遠大於設計值；潤滑脂混入砂土同樣會使摩擦暴增，轉動時出現停頓跳動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the lower plate shifts or tilts during casting, the spheres do not seat, contact concentrates locally, pads extrude or wear and friction torque far exceeds design; grease contaminated with sand also sharply raises friction, causing stick-slip jumps during rotation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b041-v13-13","title":"上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Turntables, support legs and slideway details: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「下轉盤局部承壓」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Local bearing in the lower turntable” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"球鉸把數萬噸的力量集中在直徑數公尺的範圍內，下轉盤（承台頂部）必須把這股集中力擴散到下方的樁基，同時抵抗局部壓碎與劈裂；上轉盤則把橋墩傳下的力量收攏到球鉸上，承受很大的徑向拉力。兩者都需密集配置環向與徑向鋼筋及多層鋼筋網。撐腳常為鋼管混凝土，底部有滑靴，環形滑道則是嵌入下轉盤的不鏽鋼板，平整度直接影響撐腳一旦接觸時的摩擦與衝擊。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「下轉盤局部承壓」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The hinge concentrates tens of thousands of tonnes onto an area a few metres across, so the lower turntable on top of the pile cap must spread this force into the piles while resisting local crushing and splitting; the upper turntable gathers pier forces onto the hinge and carries large radial tension. Both need dense hoop and radial reinforcement and several layers of mesh. Support legs are often concrete-filled steel tubes with sliding shoes, and the annular slideway is a stainless steel plate set into the lower turntable whose flatness governs friction and impact if a leg touches. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Local bearing in the lower turntable” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：局部承壓強度 F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Local bearing resistance F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0).","failure":"常見誤解：「承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「下轉盤局部承壓」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Local bearing in the lower turntable”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-13-k1","title":"上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部","titleEn":"Turntables, support legs and slideway details","text":"球鉸把數萬噸的力量集中在直徑數公尺的範圍內，下轉盤（承台頂部）必須把這股集中力擴散到下方的樁基，同時抵抗局部壓碎與劈裂；上轉盤則把橋墩傳下的力量收攏到球鉸上，承受很大的徑向拉力。兩者都需密集配置環向與徑向鋼筋及多層鋼筋網。","textEn":"The hinge concentrates tens of thousands of tonnes onto an area a few metres across, so the lower turntable on top of the pile cap must spread this force into the piles while resisting local crushing and splitting; the upper turntable gathers pier forces onto the hinge and carries large radial tension. Both need dense hoop and radial reinforcement and several layers of mesh.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Turntables, support legs and slideway details\" is correct?","options":["承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。","球鉸把數萬噸的力量集中在直徑數公尺的範圍內，下轉盤（承台頂部）必須把這股集中力擴散到下方的樁基，同時抵抗局部壓碎與劈裂。","牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。"],"optionsEn":["A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load.","The hinge concentrates tens of thousands of tonnes onto an area a few metres across, so the lower turntable on top of the pile cap must spread this force into the piles while resisting local crushing and splitting.","Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control."],"answer":1,"explanation":"球鉸把數萬噸的力量集中在直徑數公尺的範圍內，下轉盤（承台頂部）必須把這股集中力擴散到下方的樁基，同時抵抗局部壓碎與劈裂；上轉盤則把橋墩傳下的力量收攏到球鉸上，承受很大的徑向拉力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The hinge concentrates tens of thousands of tonnes onto an area a few metres across, so the lower turntable on top of the pile cap must spread this force into the piles while resisting local crushing and splitting; the upper turntable gathers pier forces onto the hinge and carries large radial tension. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b041-v13-14","title":"上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部：定量估算","titleEn":"Turntables, support legs and slideway details: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「下轉盤局部承壓」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Local bearing in the lower turntable” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：局部承壓強度 F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0)。C40 混凝土 f_cd = 40/1.5 ≈ 26.7 MPa；球鉸承壓直徑 4 m、擴散直徑 6 m，面積比 (6/4)² = 2.25，√2.25 = 1.5，局部承壓強度 26.7×1.5 ≈ 40 MPa，大於平均接觸應力 11.9 MPa 但仍需配置抗劈裂鋼筋。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Local bearing resistance F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0). For C40 concrete f_cd = 40/1.5 ≈ 26.7 MPa; with a 4 m loaded diameter spreading to 6 m, the area ratio is (6/4)² = 2.25 and √2.25 = 1.5, giving a local bearing strength of 26.7×1.5 ≈ 40 MPa, above the 11.9 MPa average contact stress but still requiring splitting reinforcement. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：下轉盤混凝土澆置前逐項檢查鋼筋網層數、間距與球鉸錨筋，澆置時以分層振動並監測球面板高程；環形滑道安裝後以水準儀量測全周平整度（例如任意 1 m 內高差小於 2 mm），撐腳與滑道間隙逐一記錄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before casting the lower turntable, check mesh layers, spacing and hinge anchor bars item by item, vibrate in layers while monitoring the plate level; after installing the slideway, level its full circumference, for example within 2 mm over any 1 m, and record the gap at every leg.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"局部承壓強度 F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0)。C40 混凝土 f_cd = 40/1.5 ≈ 26.7 MPa；球鉸承壓直徑 4 m、擴散直徑 6 m，面積比 (6/4)² = 2.25，√2.25 = 1.5，局部承壓強度 26.7×1.5 ≈ 40 MPa，大於平均接觸應力 11.9 MPa 但仍需配置抗劈裂鋼筋。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Local bearing resistance F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0). For C40 concrete f_cd = 40/1.5 ≈ 26.7 MPa; with a 4 m loaded diameter spreading to 6 m, the area ratio is (6/4)² = 2.25 and √2.25 = 1.5, giving a local bearing strength of 26.7×1.5 ≈ 40 MPa, above the 11.9 MPa average contact stress but still requiring splitting reinforcement. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Turntables, support legs and slideway details\", which statement holds?","options":["球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。","封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。","局部承壓強度 F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0)。"],"optionsEn":["The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing.","Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.","Local bearing resistance F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"局部承壓強度 F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Local bearing resistance F_Rdu = A_c0·f_cd·√(A_c1/A_c0). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b041-v13-15","title":"上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Turntables, support legs and slideway details: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「下轉盤局部承壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local bearing in the lower turntable” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"下轉盤混凝土澆置前逐項檢查鋼筋網層數、間距與球鉸錨筋，澆置時以分層振動並監測球面板高程；環形滑道安裝後以水準儀量測全周平整度（例如任意 1 m 內高差小於 2 mm），撐腳與滑道間隙逐一記錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before casting the lower turntable, check mesh layers, spacing and hinge anchor bars item by item, vibrate in layers while monitoring the plate level; after installing the slideway, level its full circumference, for example within 2 mm over any 1 m, and record the gap at every leg. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：下轉盤與球鉸區應以實體模型或三維鋼筋圖預先檢查可施工性，必要時改用自充填混凝土；撐腳、滑道與球鉸的安裝精度列為停留點，由監造與設計單位共同驗收。","observationEn":"Site practice: Check constructability of the lower turntable and hinge zone with a mock-up or 3D reinforcement model, using self-compacting concrete if needed; installation accuracy of legs, slideway and hinge is a hold point accepted jointly by the supervising engineer and designer.","failure":"注意干擾：下轉盤鋼筋過密而混凝土未振實，球鉸下方出現蜂窩，轉動時局部壓碎使球鉸下沉傾斜；滑道接縫錯台使撐腳一旦接觸就卡住，轉動中出現衝擊與停頓。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Congested reinforcement with poorly compacted concrete leaves honeycombing under the hinge that crushes during rotation so the hinge sinks and tilts; a step at a slideway joint snags any leg that touches, causing impacts and stalls during rotation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"下轉盤混凝土澆置前逐項檢查鋼筋網層數、間距與球鉸錨筋，澆置時以分層振動並監測球面板高程；環形滑道安裝後以水準儀量測全周平整度（例如任意 1 m 內高差小於 2 mm），撐腳與滑道間隙逐一記錄。","textEn":"Before casting the lower turntable, check mesh layers, spacing and hinge anchor bars item by item, vibrate in layers while monitoring the plate level; after installing the slideway, level its full circumference, for example within 2 mm over any 1 m, and record the gap at every leg.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"下轉盤與球鉸區應以實體模型或三維鋼筋圖預先檢查可施工性，必要時改用自充填混凝土；撐腳、滑道與球鉸的安裝精度列為停留點，由監造與設計單位共同驗收。","textEn":"Check constructability of the lower turntable and hinge zone with a mock-up or 3D reinforcement model, using self-compacting concrete if needed; installation accuracy of legs, slideway and hinge is a hold point accepted jointly by the supervising engineer and designer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Turntables, support legs and slideway details\"?","options":["下轉盤混凝土澆置前逐項檢查鋼筋網層數、間距與球鉸錨筋，澆置時以分層振動並監測球面板高程。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Before casting the lower turntable, check mesh layers, spacing and hinge anchor bars item by item, vibrate in layers while monitoring the plate level.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"下轉盤混凝土澆置前逐項檢查鋼筋網層數、間距與球鉸錨筋，澆置時以分層振動並監測球面板高程；環形滑道安裝後以水準儀量測全周平整度（例如任意 1 m 內高差小於 2 mm），撐腳與滑道間隙逐一記錄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before casting the lower turntable, check mesh layers, spacing and hinge anchor bars item by item, vibrate in layers while monitoring the plate level; after installing the slideway, level its full circumference, for example within 2 mm over any 1 m, and record the gap at every leg. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b041-v13-16","title":"上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部：失效診斷","titleEn":"Turntables, support legs and slideway details: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「下轉盤局部承壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Local bearing in the lower turntable” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"下轉盤鋼筋過密而混凝土未振實，球鉸下方出現蜂窩，轉動時局部壓碎使球鉸下沉傾斜；滑道接縫錯台使撐腳一旦接觸就卡住，轉動中出現衝擊與停頓。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Congested reinforcement with poorly compacted concrete leaves honeycombing under the hinge that crushes during rotation so the hinge sinks and tilts; a step at a slideway joint snags any leg that touches, causing impacts and stalls during rotation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：撐腳常為鋼管混凝土，底部有滑靴，環形滑道則是嵌入下轉盤的不鏽鋼板，平整度直接影響撐腳一旦接觸時的摩擦與衝擊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Support legs are often concrete-filled steel tubes with sliding shoes, and the annular slideway is a stainless steel plate set into the lower turntable whose flatness governs friction and impact if a leg touches.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"下轉盤鋼筋過密而混凝土未振實，球鉸下方出現蜂窩，轉動時局部壓碎使球鉸下沉傾斜；滑道接縫錯台使撐腳一旦接觸就卡住，轉動中出現衝擊與停頓。","textEn":"Congested reinforcement with poorly compacted concrete leaves honeycombing under the hinge that crushes during rotation so the hinge sinks and tilts; a step at a slideway joint snags any leg that touches, causing impacts and stalls during rotation.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「上下轉盤、撐腳與滑道細部」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Turntables, support legs and slideway details\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","下轉盤鋼筋過密而混凝土未振實，球鉸下方出現蜂窩，轉動時局部壓碎使球鉸下沉傾斜；滑道接縫錯台使撐腳一旦接觸就卡住，轉動中出現衝擊與停頓。","牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Congested reinforcement with poorly compacted concrete leaves honeycombing under the hinge that crushes during rotation so the hinge sinks and tilts.","Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control."],"answer":1,"explanation":"下轉盤鋼筋過密而混凝土未振實，球鉸下方出現蜂窩，轉動時局部壓碎使球鉸下沉傾斜；滑道接縫錯台使撐腳一旦接觸就卡住，轉動中出現衝擊與停頓。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Congested reinforcement with poorly compacted concrete leaves honeycombing under the hinge that crushes during rotation so the hinge sinks and tilts; a step at a slideway joint snags any leg that touches, causing impacts and stalls during rotation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b041-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「牽引系統與轉動力的配置」與「轉動到位、精調與封鉸」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Traction system and turning force\" and \"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b041-v13-17","title":"牽引系統與轉動力的配置：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Traction system and turning force: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「牽引索與連續千斤頂」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Traction strands and continuous jacks” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"水平轉體通常在上轉盤外圍纏繞鋼絞線牽引索，兩端分別接到對稱布置的兩台連續千斤頂，形成一對力偶推動結構旋轉，力偶不會對球鉸產生側向力。連續千斤頂以前後兩組夾持器交替工作，使牽引索連續前進而不需反覆換索。啟動瞬間要克服較大的靜摩擦，常另設助推千斤頂頂在撐腳或上轉盤上幫助啟動；轉動中則以較低的動摩擦力矩運行，並由電腦同步兩台千斤頂的行程與力量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「牽引索與連續千斤頂」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Horizontal rotation usually wraps strand traction cables around the upper turntable, each end connected to one of two symmetrically placed continuous jacks, forming a force couple that turns the structure without pushing the hinge sideways. Continuous jacks alternate front and rear grippers so the strands advance continuously without re-anchoring. At start-up the larger static friction must be overcome, often with auxiliary push jacks bearing on a leg or the upper turntable; during the turn the lower running friction torque applies, and a computer synchronises the strokes and forces of both jacks. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Traction strands and continuous jacks” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：牽引半徑 4.5 m、兩台千斤頂形成力偶：每台力 F = M_f/(2×4.5)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a 4.5 m traction radius and two jacks forming a couple, each jack force is F = M_f/(2×4.5).","failure":"常見誤解：「牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「牽引索與連續千斤頂」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Traction strands and continuous jacks”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-17-k1","title":"牽引系統與轉動力的配置","titleEn":"Traction system and turning force","text":"水平轉體通常在上轉盤外圍纏繞鋼絞線牽引索，兩端分別接到對稱布置的兩台連續千斤頂，形成一對力偶推動結構旋轉，力偶不會對球鉸產生側向力。連續千斤頂以前後兩組夾持器交替工作，使牽引索連續前進而不需反覆換索。","textEn":"Horizontal rotation usually wraps strand traction cables around the upper turntable, each end connected to one of two symmetrically placed continuous jacks, forming a force couple that turns the structure without pushing the hinge sideways. Continuous jacks alternate front and rear grippers so the strands advance continuously without re-anchoring.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「牽引系統與轉動力的配置」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Traction system and turning force\" is correct?","options":["牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。","萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。","水平轉體通常在上轉盤外圍纏繞鋼絞線牽引索，兩端分別接到對稱布置的兩台連續千斤頂，形成一對力偶推動結構旋轉，力偶不會對球鉸產生側向力。"],"optionsEn":["Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control.","A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.","Horizontal rotation usually wraps strand traction cables around the upper turntable, each end connected to one of two symmetrically placed continuous jacks, forming a force couple that turns the structure without pushing the hinge sideways."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水平轉體通常在上轉盤外圍纏繞鋼絞線牽引索，兩端分別接到對稱布置的兩台連續千斤頂，形成一對力偶推動結構旋轉，力偶不會對球鉸產生側向力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Horizontal rotation usually wraps strand traction cables around the upper turntable, each end connected to one of two symmetrically placed continuous jacks, forming a force couple that turns the structure without pushing the hinge sideways. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b041-v13-18","title":"牽引系統與轉動力的配置：定量估算","titleEn":"Traction system and turning force: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「牽引索與連續千斤頂」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Traction strands and continuous jacks” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：牽引半徑 4.5 m、兩台千斤頂形成力偶：每台力 F = M_f/(2×4.5)。動摩擦 μ = 0.06 時 M_f = 12,000 kN·m，F ≈ 1,333 kN；啟動靜摩擦取 μ = 0.10，M_f = 20,000 kN·m，F ≈ 2,222 kN。千斤頂額定容量宜至少為啟動力的 1.5 至 2 倍。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a 4.5 m traction radius and two jacks forming a couple, each jack force is F = M_f/(2×4.5). For running friction μ = 0.06, M_f = 12,000 kN·m and F ≈ 1,333 kN; for static breakaway μ = 0.10, M_f = 20,000 kN·m and F ≈ 2,222 kN. Rated jack capacity should be at least 1.5 to 2 times the breakaway force. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：牽引系統安裝後先做空載試運轉，確認兩台千斤頂同步、夾持器動作與油壓管路；正式轉動前做小角度試轉（例如轉動數度後停止），記錄啟動力與運行力，反算摩擦係數並與稱重試驗結果比較，再決定是否進入正式轉動。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After installation, run the traction system unloaded to confirm synchronisation, gripper action and hydraulic lines; before the main rotation, make a small trial turn of a few degrees, record breakaway and running forces, back-calculate friction and compare with the weighing test before deciding to proceed.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"牽引半徑 4.5 m、兩台千斤頂形成力偶：每台力 F = M_f/(2×4.5)。動摩擦 μ = 0.06 時 M_f = 12,000 kN·m，F ≈ 1,333 kN；啟動靜摩擦取 μ = 0.10，M_f = 20,000 kN·m，F ≈ 2,222 kN。千斤頂額定容量宜至少為啟動力的 1.5 至 2 倍。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With a 4.5 m traction radius and two jacks forming a couple, each jack force is F = M_f/(2×4.5). For running friction μ = 0.06, M_f = 12,000 kN·m and F ≈ 1,333 kN; for static breakaway μ = 0.10, M_f = 20,000 kN·m and F ≈ 2,222 kN. Rated jack capacity should be at least 1.5 to 2 times the breakaway force. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「牽引系統與轉動力的配置」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Traction system and turning force\", which statement holds?","options":["牽引半徑 4.5 m、兩台千斤頂形成力偶：每台力 F = M_f/(2×4.5)。","轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。","跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。"],"optionsEn":["With a 4.5 m traction radius and two jacks forming a couple, each jack force is F = M_f/(2×4.5).","Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival.","Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"牽引半徑 4.5 m、兩台千斤頂形成力偶：每台力 F = M_f/(2×4.5)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a 4.5 m traction radius and two jacks forming a couple, each jack force is F = M_f/(2×4.5). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b041-v13-19","title":"牽引系統與轉動力的配置：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Traction system and turning force: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「牽引索與連續千斤頂」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Traction strands and continuous jacks” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"牽引系統安裝後先做空載試運轉，確認兩台千斤頂同步、夾持器動作與油壓管路；正式轉動前做小角度試轉（例如轉動數度後停止），記錄啟動力與運行力，反算摩擦係數並與稱重試驗結果比較，再決定是否進入正式轉動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After installation, run the traction system unloaded to confirm synchronisation, gripper action and hydraulic lines; before the main rotation, make a small trial turn of a few degrees, record breakaway and running forces, back-calculate friction and compare with the weighing test before deciding to proceed. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：牽引系統設計、試運轉與試轉都列為停留點，由專業技師與設計單位簽認；轉動指揮由單一總指揮下令，每一個監測點都能直接下達停止指令。","observationEn":"Site practice: Traction design, unloaded trial and trial turn are hold points signed by a qualified engineer and the designer; the rotation is commanded by a single director, and every monitoring post can order an immediate stop.","failure":"注意干擾：兩台千斤頂不同步時，力偶變成合力，對球鉸施加水平推力，結構偏離中心或撐腳單側受壓；牽引索在轉盤槽內交疊或跳槽，會使牽引力突然下降，結構在慣性與風力下產生非預期擺動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Unsynchronised jacks turn the couple into a net force that pushes the hinge sideways, shifting the structure off-centre or loading legs on one side; strands overlapping or jumping out of the turntable groove cause a sudden loss of traction and unplanned swinging under wind. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"牽引系統安裝後先做空載試運轉，確認兩台千斤頂同步、夾持器動作與油壓管路；正式轉動前做小角度試轉（例如轉動數度後停止），記錄啟動力與運行力，反算摩擦係數並與稱重試驗結果比較，再決定是否進入正式轉動。","textEn":"After installation, run the traction system unloaded to confirm synchronisation, gripper action and hydraulic lines; before the main rotation, make a small trial turn of a few degrees, record breakaway and running forces, back-calculate friction and compare with the weighing test before deciding to proceed.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"牽引系統設計、試運轉與試轉都列為停留點，由專業技師與設計單位簽認；轉動指揮由單一總指揮下令，每一個監測點都能直接下達停止指令。","textEn":"Traction design, unloaded trial and trial turn are hold points signed by a qualified engineer and the designer; the rotation is commanded by a single director, and every monitoring post can order an immediate stop.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「牽引系統與轉動力的配置」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Traction system and turning force\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","牽引系統安裝後先做空載試運轉，確認兩台千斤頂同步、夾持器動作與油壓管路。","對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","After installation, run the traction system unloaded to confirm synchronisation, gripper action and hydraulic lines.","A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast."],"answer":1,"explanation":"牽引系統安裝後先做空載試運轉，確認兩台千斤頂同步、夾持器動作與油壓管路；正式轉動前做小角度試轉（例如轉動數度後停止），記錄啟動力與運行力，反算摩擦係數並與稱重試驗結果比較，再決定是否進入正式轉動。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"After installation, run the traction system unloaded to confirm synchronisation, gripper action and hydraulic lines; before the main rotation, make a small trial turn of a few degrees, record breakaway and running forces, back-calculate friction and compare with the weighing test before deciding to proceed. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b041-v13-20","title":"牽引系統與轉動力的配置：失效診斷","titleEn":"Traction system and turning force: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「牽引索與連續千斤頂」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Traction strands and continuous jacks” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"兩台千斤頂不同步時，力偶變成合力，對球鉸施加水平推力，結構偏離中心或撐腳單側受壓；牽引索在轉盤槽內交疊或跳槽，會使牽引力突然下降，結構在慣性與風力下產生非預期擺動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Unsynchronised jacks turn the couple into a net force that pushes the hinge sideways, shifting the structure off-centre or loading legs on one side; strands overlapping or jumping out of the turntable groove cause a sudden loss of traction and unplanned swinging under wind. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：啟動瞬間要克服較大的靜摩擦，常另設助推千斤頂頂在撐腳或上轉盤上幫助啟動；轉動中則以較低的動摩擦力矩運行，並由電腦同步兩台千斤頂的行程與力量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: At start-up the larger static friction must be overcome, often with auxiliary push jacks bearing on a leg or the upper turntable; during the turn the lower running friction torque applies, and a computer synchronises the strokes and forces of both jacks.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"兩台千斤頂不同步時，力偶變成合力，對球鉸施加水平推力，結構偏離中心或撐腳單側受壓；牽引索在轉盤槽內交疊或跳槽，會使牽引力突然下降，結構在慣性與風力下產生非預期擺動。","textEn":"Unsynchronised jacks turn the couple into a net force that pushes the hinge sideways, shifting the structure off-centre or loading legs on one side; strands overlapping or jumping out of the turntable groove cause a sudden loss of traction and unplanned swinging under wind.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「牽引系統與轉動力的配置」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Traction system and turning force\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。","兩台千斤頂不同步時，力偶變成合力，對球鉸施加水平推力，結構偏離中心或撐腳單側受壓。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.","Unsynchronised jacks turn the couple into a net force that pushes the hinge sideways, shifting the structure off-centre or loading legs on one side."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩台千斤頂不同步時，力偶變成合力，對球鉸施加水平推力，結構偏離中心或撐腳單側受壓；牽引索在轉盤槽內交疊或跳槽，會使牽引力突然下降，結構在慣性與風力下產生非預期擺動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Unsynchronised jacks turn the couple into a net force that pushes the hinge sideways, shifting the structure off-centre or loading legs on one side; strands overlapping or jumping out of the turntable groove cause a sudden loss of traction and unplanned swinging under wind. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b041-v13-21","title":"轉動到位、精調與封鉸：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「到位限位與封鉸混凝土」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Stop blocks and hinge encasement” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"萬噸級結構以每分鐘幾公分的角速度轉動，動能其實很小，真正難的是精度：接近設計軸線時改為點動，每次只移動很小的距離，並在轉盤設置限位塊防止超轉。到位後以千斤頂微調軸線、高程與橫坡，接著以鋼楔或鋼支撐把上轉盤與下轉盤臨時鎖死，再在球鉸與撐腳周圍澆置封鉸混凝土，使轉動機構變成固結的墩底，最後與相鄰跨進行合龍。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「到位限位與封鉸混凝土」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes turning at a few centimetres per minute has very little kinetic energy; the difficulty is precision. Near the design axis the jacks switch to inching, moving a tiny distance each time, and stop blocks on the turntable prevent over-rotation. On arrival, jacks fine-tune axis, level and cross-fall, steel wedges or struts temporarily lock the upper turntable to the lower, and encasement concrete is cast around the hinge and legs so the mechanism becomes a fixed pier base before closure with the adjacent spans. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Stop blocks and hinge encasement” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以兩側 60 m 懸臂近似，迴轉半徑 r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m，質量 m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg，I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²；ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s，動能 ½Iω² ≈ 1.6 kJ，極小。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Treating two 60 m arms, the radius of gyration r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m, mass m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg and I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²; at ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s the kinetic energy ½Iω² is only about 1.6 kJ.","failure":"常見誤解：「萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「到位限位與封鉸混凝土」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Stop blocks and hinge encasement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-21-k1","title":"轉動到位、精調與封鉸","titleEn":"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement","text":"萬噸級結構以每分鐘幾公分的角速度轉動，動能其實很小，真正難的是精度：接近設計軸線時改為點動，每次只移動很小的距離，並在轉盤設置限位塊防止超轉。到位後以千斤頂微調軸線、高程與橫坡，接著以鋼楔或鋼支撐把上轉盤與下轉盤臨時鎖死，再在球鉸與撐腳周圍澆置封鉸混凝土，使轉動機構變成固結的墩底，最後與相鄰跨進行合龍。","textEn":"A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes turning at a few centimetres per minute has very little kinetic energy; the difficulty is precision. Near the design axis the jacks switch to inching, moving a tiny distance each time, and stop blocks on the turntable prevent over-rotation.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉動到位、精調與封鉸」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement\" is correct?","options":["萬噸級結構以每分鐘幾公分的角速度轉動，動能其實很小，真正難的是精度：接近設計軸線時改為點動，每次只移動很小的距離，並在轉盤設置限位塊防止超轉。","萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。","球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。"],"optionsEn":["A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes turning at a few centimetres per minute has very little kinetic energy; the difficulty is precision.","A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.","The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"萬噸級結構以每分鐘幾公分的角速度轉動，動能其實很小，真正難的是精度：接近設計軸線時改為點動，每次只移動很小的距離，並在轉盤設置限位塊防止超轉。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes turning at a few centimetres per minute has very little kinetic energy; the difficulty is precision. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b041-v13-22","title":"轉動到位、精調與封鉸：定量估算","titleEn":"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「到位限位與封鉸混凝土」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Stop blocks and hinge encasement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以兩側 60 m 懸臂近似，迴轉半徑 r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m，質量 m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg，I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²；ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s，動能 ½Iω² ≈ 1.6 kJ，極小。端點定位 ±10 mm 等於轉角 0.010/60 ≈ 1.67×10⁻⁴ rad，對應 4.5 m 牽引半徑上僅約 0.75 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Treating two 60 m arms, the radius of gyration r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m, mass m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg and I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²; at ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s the kinetic energy ½Iω² is only about 1.6 kJ. Positioning a tip to ±10 mm means 0.010/60 ≈ 1.67×10⁻⁴ rad, only about 0.75 mm at the 4.5 m traction radius. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：接近終點時以全站儀連續量測兩懸臂端座標，換算剩餘轉角並逐次點動；到位後確認軸線、高程與相鄰跨端點的對位在允差內（例如軸線 ±10 mm），鎖定後再複測一次，封鉸混凝土澆置前檢查鋼筋與清潔，並追蹤試體強度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Near the end, track both tip coordinates continuously with total stations, convert to the remaining angle and inch accordingly; on arrival confirm axis, level and alignment with adjacent span ends within tolerance, for example ±10 mm on axis, re-survey after locking, check reinforcement and cleanliness before casting the encasement and track cylinder strength.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以兩側 60 m 懸臂近似，迴轉半徑 r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m，質量 m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg，I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²；ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s，動能 ½Iω² ≈ 1.6 kJ，極小。端點定位 ±10 mm 等於轉角 0.010/60 ≈ 1.67×10⁻⁴ rad，對應 4.5 m 牽引半徑上僅約 0.75 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Treating two 60 m arms, the radius of gyration r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m, mass m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg and I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²; at ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s the kinetic energy ½Iω² is only about 1.6 kJ. Positioning a tip to ±10 mm means 0.010/60 ≈ 1.67×10⁻⁴ rad, only about 0.75 mm at the 4.5 m traction radius. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉動到位、精調與封鉸」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement\", which statement holds?","options":["封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。","以兩側 60 m 懸臂近似，迴轉半徑 r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m，質量 m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg，I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²。","轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.","Treating two 60 m arms, the radius of gyration r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m, mass m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg and I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m².","Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以兩側 60 m 懸臂近似，迴轉半徑 r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m，質量 m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg，I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²；ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s，動能 ½Iω² ≈ 1.6 kJ，極小。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Treating two 60 m arms, the radius of gyration r_g = 60/√3 ≈ 34.6 m, mass m = 150,000 kN/9.81 ≈ 15.3×10⁶ kg and I = m·r_g² ≈ 1.83×10¹⁰ kg·m²; at ω = 0.025 rad/min ≈ 4.17×10⁻⁴ rad/s the kinetic energy ½Iω² is only about 1.6 kJ. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b041-v13-23","title":"轉動到位、精調與封鉸：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「到位限位與封鉸混凝土」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Stop blocks and hinge encasement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"接近終點時以全站儀連續量測兩懸臂端座標，換算剩餘轉角並逐次點動；到位後確認軸線、高程與相鄰跨端點的對位在允差內（例如軸線 ±10 mm），鎖定後再複測一次，封鉸混凝土澆置前檢查鋼筋與清潔，並追蹤試體強度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Near the end, track both tip coordinates continuously with total stations, convert to the remaining angle and inch accordingly; on arrival confirm axis, level and alignment with adjacent span ends within tolerance, for example ±10 mm on axis, re-survey after locking, check reinforcement and cleanliness before casting the encasement and track cylinder strength. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：轉動程序書須明訂點動開始的剩餘角度、限位塊位置、鎖定方式與封鉸澆置條件；鎖定與封鉸完成前，任何人不得移除牽引或限位裝置，並由設計單位確認封固後的體系轉換。","observationEn":"Site practice: The rotation procedure must specify the remaining angle at which inching begins, stop-block positions, the locking method and encasement conditions; no one may remove traction or stop devices before locking and encasement are complete, and the designer confirms the system change after fixing.","failure":"注意干擾：千斤頂控制解析度不足或靜摩擦黏滑，結構在終點前一下停滯、一下跳動，容易超轉；未先鎖定就開始封鉸，溫度變化或風力使結構在混凝土初凝期間微轉，封鉸混凝土開裂。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Coarse jack control or stick-slip friction makes the structure stall and jump near the end, easily overshooting; starting encasement before locking lets temperature or wind turn the structure slightly while the concrete sets, cracking the encasement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"接近終點時以全站儀連續量測兩懸臂端座標，換算剩餘轉角並逐次點動；到位後確認軸線、高程與相鄰跨端點的對位在允差內（例如軸線 ±10 mm），鎖定後再複測一次，封鉸混凝土澆置前檢查鋼筋與清潔，並追蹤試體強度。","textEn":"Near the end, track both tip coordinates continuously with total stations, convert to the remaining angle and inch accordingly; on arrival confirm axis, level and alignment with adjacent span ends within tolerance, for example ±10 mm on axis, re-survey after locking, check reinforcement and cleanliness before casting the encasement and track cylinder strength.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"轉動程序書須明訂點動開始的剩餘角度、限位塊位置、鎖定方式與封鉸澆置條件；鎖定與封鉸完成前，任何人不得移除牽引或限位裝置，並由設計單位確認封固後的體系轉換。","textEn":"The rotation procedure must specify the remaining angle at which inching begins, stop-block positions, the locking method and encasement conditions; no one may remove traction or stop devices before locking and encasement are complete, and the designer confirms the system change after fixing.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉動到位、精調與封鉸」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。","接近終點時以全站儀連續量測兩懸臂端座標，換算剩餘轉角並逐次點動。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.","Near the end, track both tip coordinates continuously with total stations, convert to the remaining angle and inch accordingly."],"answer":2,"explanation":"接近終點時以全站儀連續量測兩懸臂端座標，換算剩餘轉角並逐次點動；到位後確認軸線、高程與相鄰跨端點的對位在允差內（例如軸線 ±10 mm），鎖定後再複測一次，封鉸混凝土澆置前檢查鋼筋與清潔，並追蹤試體強度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Near the end, track both tip coordinates continuously with total stations, convert to the remaining angle and inch accordingly; on arrival confirm axis, level and alignment with adjacent span ends within tolerance, for example ±10 mm on axis, re-survey after locking, check reinforcement and cleanliness before casting the encasement and track cylinder strength. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b041-v13-24","title":"轉動到位、精調與封鉸：失效診斷","titleEn":"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「到位限位與封鉸混凝土」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stop blocks and hinge encasement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"千斤頂控制解析度不足或靜摩擦黏滑，結構在終點前一下停滯、一下跳動，容易超轉；未先鎖定就開始封鉸，溫度變化或風力使結構在混凝土初凝期間微轉，封鉸混凝土開裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Coarse jack control or stick-slip friction makes the structure stall and jump near the end, easily overshooting; starting encasement before locking lets temperature or wind turn the structure slightly while the concrete sets, cracking the encasement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：到位後以千斤頂微調軸線、高程與橫坡，接著以鋼楔或鋼支撐把上轉盤與下轉盤臨時鎖死，再在球鉸與撐腳周圍澆置封鉸混凝土，使轉動機構變成固結的墩底，最後與相鄰跨進行合龍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: On arrival, jacks fine-tune axis, level and cross-fall, steel wedges or struts temporarily lock the upper turntable to the lower, and encasement concrete is cast around the hinge and legs so the mechanism becomes a fixed pier base before closure with the adjacent spans.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"千斤頂控制解析度不足或靜摩擦黏滑，結構在終點前一下停滯、一下跳動，容易超轉；未先鎖定就開始封鉸，溫度變化或風力使結構在混凝土初凝期間微轉，封鉸混凝土開裂。","textEn":"Coarse jack control or stick-slip friction makes the structure stall and jump near the end, easily overshooting; starting encasement before locking lets temperature or wind turn the structure slightly while the concrete sets, cracking the encasement.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉動到位、精調與封鉸」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Arrival, fine adjustment and hinge encasement\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["千斤頂控制解析度不足或靜摩擦黏滑，結構在終點前一下停滯、一下跳動，容易超轉；未先鎖定就開始封鉸，溫度變化或風力使結構在混凝土初凝期間微轉，封鉸混凝土開裂。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。"],"optionsEn":["Coarse jack control or stick-slip friction makes the structure stall and jump near the end, easily overshooting.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"千斤頂控制解析度不足或靜摩擦黏滑，結構在終點前一下停滯、一下跳動，容易超轉；未先鎖定就開始封鉸，溫度變化或風力使結構在混凝土初凝期間微轉，封鉸混凝土開裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Coarse jack control or stick-slip friction makes the structure stall and jump near the end, easily overshooting; starting encasement before locking lets temperature or wind turn the structure slightly while the concrete sets, cracking the encasement. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b041-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「轉動前稱重試驗」與「轉動過程監測與停機條件」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pre-rotation weighing test\" and \"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b041-v13-25","title":"轉動前稱重試驗：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pre-rotation weighing test: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「稱重試驗與不平衡力矩」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Weighing test and unbalanced moment” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"拆除臨時支撐、讓結構完全落在球鉸上之後，要做稱重試驗：在撐腳附近兩側以千斤頂分別向上頂，量測千斤頂力與位移，找出位移突然增加的轉折點，代表結構開始繞球鉸轉動。由兩側的轉折點力量，可以同時解出重心偏心造成的不平衡力矩與球鉸的摩擦力矩，進而決定配重量與牽引力。這是轉體前唯一能直接量到真實狀態的機會，數據品質決定了後續所有判斷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「稱重試驗與不平衡力矩」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After temporary supports are removed and the structure rests fully on the hinge, a weighing test is carried out: jacks near the legs on each side push upward in turn while force and displacement are measured, and the point where displacement suddenly increases marks the start of rotation about the hinge. The turning-point forces from both sides solve simultaneously for the unbalanced moment due to eccentricity and the hinge friction moment, which then set the ballast and traction force. It is the only chance before rotation to measure the real state directly, and its data quality governs every later decision. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Weighing test and unbalanced moment” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：兩側千斤頂距中心 a = 4.0 m，轉折力 P₁ = 2,600 kN、P₂ = 1,100 kN：不平衡力矩 M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m，摩擦力矩 M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With jacks at a = 4.0 m from the centre and turning-point forces P₁ = 2,600 kN and P₂ = 1,100 kN, the unbalanced moment is M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m and the friction moment M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m.","failure":"常見誤解：「球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「稱重試驗與不平衡力矩」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Weighing test and unbalanced moment”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-25-k1","title":"轉動前稱重試驗","titleEn":"Pre-rotation weighing test","text":"拆除臨時支撐、讓結構完全落在球鉸上之後，要做稱重試驗：在撐腳附近兩側以千斤頂分別向上頂，量測千斤頂力與位移，找出位移突然增加的轉折點，代表結構開始繞球鉸轉動。由兩側的轉折點力量，可以同時解出重心偏心造成的不平衡力矩與球鉸的摩擦力矩，進而決定配重量與牽引力。","textEn":"After temporary supports are removed and the structure rests fully on the hinge, a weighing test is carried out: jacks near the legs on each side push upward in turn while force and displacement are measured, and the point where displacement suddenly increases marks the start of rotation about the hinge. The turning-point forces from both sides solve simultaneously for the unbalanced moment due to eccentricity and the hinge friction moment, which then set the ballast and traction force.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉動前稱重試驗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pre-rotation weighing test\" is correct?","options":["球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。","拆除臨時支撐、讓結構完全落在球鉸上之後，要做稱重試驗：在撐腳附近兩側以千斤頂分別向上頂，量測千斤頂力與位移，找出位移突然增加的轉折點，代表結構開始繞球鉸轉動。","轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。"],"optionsEn":["The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing.","After temporary supports are removed and the structure rests fully on the hinge, a weighing test is carried out: jacks near the legs on each side push upward in turn while force and displacement are measured, and the point where displacement suddenly increases marks the start of rotation about the hinge.","Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival."],"answer":1,"explanation":"拆除臨時支撐、讓結構完全落在球鉸上之後，要做稱重試驗：在撐腳附近兩側以千斤頂分別向上頂，量測千斤頂力與位移，找出位移突然增加的轉折點，代表結構開始繞球鉸轉動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After temporary supports are removed and the structure rests fully on the hinge, a weighing test is carried out: jacks near the legs on each side push upward in turn while force and displacement are measured, and the point where displacement suddenly increases marks the start of rotation about the hinge. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b041-v13-26","title":"轉動前稱重試驗：定量估算","titleEn":"Pre-rotation weighing test: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「稱重試驗與不平衡力矩」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Weighing test and unbalanced moment” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：兩側千斤頂距中心 a = 4.0 m，轉折力 P₁ = 2,600 kN、P₂ = 1,100 kN：不平衡力矩 M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m，摩擦力矩 M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m。偏心 e = 3,000/150,000 = 0.02 m，摩擦係數 μ = 3M_F/(2WR) = 3×7,400/(2×150,000×2.0) ≈ 0.037。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With jacks at a = 4.0 m from the centre and turning-point forces P₁ = 2,600 kN and P₂ = 1,100 kN, the unbalanced moment is M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m and the friction moment M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m. The eccentricity is e = 3,000/150,000 = 0.02 m and the friction coefficient μ = 3M_F/(2WR) = 3×7,400/(2×150,000×2.0) ≈ 0.037. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：千斤頂與位移計須事先校正，加載以小級距進行並繪製力—位移曲線，以兩種方法（曲線轉折點與切線交點）判讀並取一致結果；試驗至少重複一次，偏心與摩擦結果與施工重量計算比較，差異過大須查明原因並由設計單位決定配重。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate jacks and displacement gauges beforehand, load in small steps and plot force–displacement curves, read the turning point by two methods (curve break and tangent intersection) and require agreement; repeat at least once, compare eccentricity and friction with the construction weight calculation, and have the designer decide on ballast if they differ significantly.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"兩側千斤頂距中心 a = 4.0 m，轉折力 P₁ = 2,600 kN、P₂ = 1,100 kN：不平衡力矩 M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m，摩擦力矩 M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m。偏心 e = 3,000/150,000 = 0.02 m，摩擦係數 μ = 3M_F/(2WR) = 3×7,400/(2×150,000×2.0) ≈ 0.037。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With jacks at a = 4.0 m from the centre and turning-point forces P₁ = 2,600 kN and P₂ = 1,100 kN, the unbalanced moment is M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m and the friction moment M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m. The eccentricity is e = 3,000/150,000 = 0.02 m and the friction coefficient μ = 3M_F/(2WR) = 3×7,400/(2×150,000×2.0) ≈ 0.037. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉動前稱重試驗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pre-rotation weighing test\", which statement holds?","options":["跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。","對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。","兩側千斤頂距中心 a = 4.0 m，轉折力 P₁ = 2,600 kN、P₂ = 1,100 kN：不平衡力矩 M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m，摩擦力矩 M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m。"],"optionsEn":["Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion.","A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast.","With jacks at a = 4.0 m from the centre and turning-point forces P₁ = 2,600 kN and P₂ = 1,100 kN, the unbalanced moment is M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m and the friction moment M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩側千斤頂距中心 a = 4.0 m，轉折力 P₁ = 2,600 kN、P₂ = 1,100 kN：不平衡力矩 M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m，摩擦力矩 M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With jacks at a = 4.0 m from the centre and turning-point forces P₁ = 2,600 kN and P₂ = 1,100 kN, the unbalanced moment is M_G = (P₁ − P₂)·a/2 = 3,000 kN·m and the friction moment M_F = (P₁ + P₂)·a/2 = 7,400 kN·m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b041-v13-27","title":"轉動前稱重試驗：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pre-rotation weighing test: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「稱重試驗與不平衡力矩」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Weighing test and unbalanced moment” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"千斤頂與位移計須事先校正，加載以小級距進行並繪製力—位移曲線，以兩種方法（曲線轉折點與切線交點）判讀並取一致結果；試驗至少重複一次，偏心與摩擦結果與施工重量計算比較，差異過大須查明原因並由設計單位決定配重。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate jacks and displacement gauges beforehand, load in small steps and plot force–displacement curves, read the turning point by two methods (curve break and tangent intersection) and require agreement; repeat at least once, compare eccentricity and friction with the construction weight calculation, and have the designer decide on ballast if they differ significantly. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：稱重試驗前由監造確認所有臨時支撐、砂箱與鎖定裝置已解除並拍照記錄；試驗報告須含原始資料、判讀方法、計算結果與配重建議，經設計單位簽認後才能進入試轉。","observationEn":"Site practice: Before the weighing test the supervising engineer confirms and photographs the release of all temporary supports, sand boxes and locks; the report must contain raw data, interpretation method, results and ballast recommendation, signed by the designer before any trial turn.","failure":"注意干擾：若稱重時臨時支撐或砂箱未完全拆除，部分重量仍由支撐承擔，量到的摩擦力矩偏低、偏心判斷錯誤，正式轉動時牽引力不足或結構突然傾向一側。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If temporary supports or sand boxes are not fully removed, part of the weight bypasses the hinge, so measured friction is too low and eccentricity is misjudged; during the actual rotation traction proves insufficient or the structure suddenly leans to one side. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"千斤頂與位移計須事先校正，加載以小級距進行並繪製力—位移曲線，以兩種方法（曲線轉折點與切線交點）判讀並取一致結果；試驗至少重複一次，偏心與摩擦結果與施工重量計算比較，差異過大須查明原因並由設計單位決定配重。","textEn":"Calibrate jacks and displacement gauges beforehand, load in small steps and plot force–displacement curves, read the turning point by two methods (curve break and tangent intersection) and require agreement; repeat at least once, compare eccentricity and friction with the construction weight calculation, and have the designer decide on ballast if they differ significantly.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"稱重試驗前由監造確認所有臨時支撐、砂箱與鎖定裝置已解除並拍照記錄；試驗報告須含原始資料、判讀方法、計算結果與配重建議，經設計單位簽認後才能進入試轉。","textEn":"Before the weighing test the supervising engineer confirms and photographs the release of all temporary supports, sand boxes and locks; the report must contain raw data, interpretation method, results and ballast recommendation, signed by the designer before any trial turn.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉動前稱重試驗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pre-rotation weighing test\"?","options":["千斤頂與位移計須事先校正，加載以小級距進行並繪製力—位移曲線，以兩種方法（曲線轉折點與切線交點）判讀並取一致結果。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。"],"optionsEn":["Calibrate jacks and displacement gauges beforehand, load in small steps and plot force–displacement curves, read the turning point by two methods (curve break and tangent intersection) and require agreement.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load."],"answer":0,"explanation":"千斤頂與位移計須事先校正，加載以小級距進行並繪製力—位移曲線，以兩種方法（曲線轉折點與切線交點）判讀並取一致結果；試驗至少重複一次，偏心與摩擦結果與施工重量計算比較，差異過大須查明原因並由設計單位決定配重。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate jacks and displacement gauges beforehand, load in small steps and plot force–displacement curves, read the turning point by two methods (curve break and tangent intersection) and require agreement; repeat at least once, compare eccentricity and friction with the construction weight calculation, and have the designer decide on ballast if they differ significantly. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b041-v13-28","title":"轉動前稱重試驗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pre-rotation weighing test: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「稱重試驗與不平衡力矩」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Weighing test and unbalanced moment” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若稱重時臨時支撐或砂箱未完全拆除，部分重量仍由支撐承擔，量到的摩擦力矩偏低、偏心判斷錯誤，正式轉動時牽引力不足或結構突然傾向一側。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If temporary supports or sand boxes are not fully removed, part of the weight bypasses the hinge, so measured friction is too low and eccentricity is misjudged; during the actual rotation traction proves insufficient or the structure suddenly leans to one side. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這是轉體前唯一能直接量到真實狀態的機會，數據品質決定了後續所有判斷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It is the only chance before rotation to measure the real state directly, and its data quality governs every later decision.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若稱重時臨時支撐或砂箱未完全拆除，部分重量仍由支撐承擔，量到的摩擦力矩偏低、偏心判斷錯誤，正式轉動時牽引力不足或結構突然傾向一側。","textEn":"If temporary supports or sand boxes are not fully removed, part of the weight bypasses the hinge, so measured friction is too low and eccentricity is misjudged; during the actual rotation traction proves insufficient or the structure suddenly leans to one side.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉動前稱重試驗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pre-rotation weighing test\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若稱重時臨時支撐或砂箱未完全拆除，部分重量仍由支撐承擔，量到的摩擦力矩偏低、偏心判斷錯誤，正式轉動時牽引力不足或結構突然傾向一側。","轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","If temporary supports or sand boxes are not fully removed, part of the weight bypasses the hinge, so measured friction is too low and eccentricity is misjudged.","Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若稱重時臨時支撐或砂箱未完全拆除，部分重量仍由支撐承擔，量到的摩擦力矩偏低、偏心判斷錯誤，正式轉動時牽引力不足或結構突然傾向一側。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If temporary supports or sand boxes are not fully removed, part of the weight bypasses the hinge, so measured friction is too low and eccentricity is misjudged; during the actual rotation traction proves insufficient or the structure suddenly leans to one side. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b041-v13-29","title":"轉動過程監測與停機條件：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「轉動中監測與風速限制」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Monitoring and wind limits during rotation” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"轉動期間結構處於一個與完工或施工階段都不同的臨時狀態：只有中心一點支承、兩側長懸臂、撐腳懸空。監測重點包括轉角與端點座標、兩懸臂端高程差、撐腳與滑道間隙、牽引力、墩身或轉盤應變，以及現場風速。風對長懸臂的影響主要不是水平扭轉，而是兩側不對稱的上揚或下壓力造成傾斜，可能使撐腳接觸滑道。每一項都必須事先設定警戒值與停止值。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「轉動中監測與風速限制」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"During rotation the structure is in a temporary state unlike both construction and service: supported at a single central point with two long cantilevers and legs in the air. Monitoring covers rotation angle and tip coordinates, level difference between the tips, leg-to-slideway gaps, traction forces, pier or turntable strains and site wind speed. Wind acts on long cantilevers less through horizontal twisting than through unequal uplift or downward pressure on the two sides, which tilts the structure and can bring legs onto the slideway. Every quantity needs alert and stop values set in advance. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Monitoring and wind limits during rotation” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：風速 15 m/s 時動壓 q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa；一側懸臂寬 16 m、長 60 m，上揚係數 0.5 時 F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN，作用於 30 m 處的傾覆力矩約 2,025 kN·m；與稱重殘餘不平衡 3,000 kN·m 疊加為 5,025 kN·m，若撐腳半徑 4.0 m 接觸，撐腳力約 1,256 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At 15 m/s the dynamic pressure is q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa; for one arm 16 m wide and 60 m long with an uplift coefficient of 0.5, F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN acting at 30 m gives about 2,025 kN·m of tilting moment; added to the 3,000 kN·m residual imbalance from weighing, the total is 5,025 kN·m, so a leg touching at 4.0 m radius carries about 1,256 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「轉動中監測與風速限制」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Monitoring and wind limits during rotation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-29-k1","title":"轉動過程監測與停機條件","titleEn":"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation","text":"轉動期間結構處於一個與完工或施工階段都不同的臨時狀態：只有中心一點支承、兩側長懸臂、撐腳懸空。監測重點包括轉角與端點座標、兩懸臂端高程差、撐腳與滑道間隙、牽引力、墩身或轉盤應變，以及現場風速。","textEn":"During rotation the structure is in a temporary state unlike both construction and service: supported at a single central point with two long cantilevers and legs in the air. Monitoring covers rotation angle and tip coordinates, level difference between the tips, leg-to-slideway gaps, traction forces, pier or turntable strains and site wind speed.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉動過程監測與停機條件」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation\" is correct?","options":["轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。","封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。","轉動期間結構處於一個與完工或施工階段都不同的臨時狀態：只有中心一點支承、兩側長懸臂、撐腳懸空。"],"optionsEn":["Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival.","Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.","During rotation the structure is in a temporary state unlike both construction and service: supported at a single central point with two long cantilevers and legs in the air."],"answer":2,"explanation":"轉動期間結構處於一個與完工或施工階段都不同的臨時狀態：只有中心一點支承、兩側長懸臂、撐腳懸空。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"During rotation the structure is in a temporary state unlike both construction and service: supported at a single central point with two long cantilevers and legs in the air. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b041-v13-30","title":"轉動過程監測與停機條件：定量估算","titleEn":"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉動中監測與風速限制」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Monitoring and wind limits during rotation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：風速 15 m/s 時動壓 q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa；一側懸臂寬 16 m、長 60 m，上揚係數 0.5 時 F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN，作用於 30 m 處的傾覆力矩約 2,025 kN·m；與稱重殘餘不平衡 3,000 kN·m 疊加為 5,025 kN·m，若撐腳半徑 4.0 m 接觸，撐腳力約 1,256 kN。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At 15 m/s the dynamic pressure is q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa; for one arm 16 m wide and 60 m long with an uplift coefficient of 0.5, F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN acting at 30 m gives about 2,025 kN·m of tilting moment; added to the 3,000 kN·m residual imbalance from weighing, the total is 5,025 kN·m, so a leg touching at 4.0 m radius carries about 1,256 kN. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：轉動前確認氣象預報與現場風速計運作，訂定轉動上限風速；轉動中由監測中心整合全站儀、間隙感測器、千斤頂壓力與應變資料即時顯示，任一項達警戒值即減速，達停止值即停機鎖定，所有資料以同一時間基準保存。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before rotation confirm the forecast and that site anemometers work, and set a maximum wind speed; during rotation a monitoring centre combines total-station, gap-sensor, jack-pressure and strain data in real time, slowing at any alert value and stopping and locking at any stop value, with all data stored on a common time base.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"風速 15 m/s 時動壓 q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa；一側懸臂寬 16 m、長 60 m，上揚係數 0.5 時 F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN，作用於 30 m 處的傾覆力矩約 2,025 kN·m；與稱重殘餘不平衡 3,000 kN·m 疊加為 5,025 kN·m，若撐腳半徑 4.0 m 接觸，撐腳力約 1,256 kN。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"At 15 m/s the dynamic pressure is q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa; for one arm 16 m wide and 60 m long with an uplift coefficient of 0.5, F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN acting at 30 m gives about 2,025 kN·m of tilting moment; added to the 3,000 kN·m residual imbalance from weighing, the total is 5,025 kN·m, so a leg touching at 4.0 m radius carries about 1,256 kN. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉動過程監測與停機條件」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation\", which statement holds?","options":["風速 15 m/s 時動壓 q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa。","轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。","球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。"],"optionsEn":["At 15 m/s the dynamic pressure is q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa.","Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction.","A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn."],"answer":0,"explanation":"風速 15 m/s 時動壓 q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa；一側懸臂寬 16 m、長 60 m，上揚係數 0.5 時 F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN，作用於 30 m 處的傾覆力矩約 2,025 kN·m；與稱重殘餘不平衡 3,000 kN·m 疊加為 5,025 kN·m，若撐腳半徑 4.0 m 接觸，撐腳力約 1,256 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At 15 m/s the dynamic pressure is q = 0.5×1.25×15² ≈ 141 Pa; for one arm 16 m wide and 60 m long with an uplift coefficient of 0.5, F = 0.5×141×960 ≈ 67.5 kN acting at 30 m gives about 2,025 kN·m of tilting moment; added to the 3,000 kN·m residual imbalance from weighing, the total is 5,025 kN·m, so a leg touching at 4.0 m radius carries about 1,256 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b041-v13-31","title":"轉動過程監測與停機條件：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉動中監測與風速限制」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Monitoring and wind limits during rotation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"轉動前確認氣象預報與現場風速計運作，訂定轉動上限風速；轉動中由監測中心整合全站儀、間隙感測器、千斤頂壓力與應變資料即時顯示，任一項達警戒值即減速，達停止值即停機鎖定，所有資料以同一時間基準保存。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before rotation confirm the forecast and that site anemometers work, and set a maximum wind speed; during rotation a monitoring centre combines total-station, gap-sensor, jack-pressure and strain data in real time, slowing at any alert value and stopping and locking at any stop value, with all data stored on a common time base. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：轉動作業前召開停留點會議，確認監測項目、警戒與停止值、通訊方式、風速限制與緊急鎖定程序；總指揮、設計代表、監造與鐵路或航道主管機關代表均需在場。","observationEn":"Site practice: Hold a hold-point meeting before rotation to confirm monitored items, alert and stop values, communications, wind limit and emergency locking; the rotation director, design representative, supervising engineer and the railway or waterway authority representative must all be present.","failure":"注意干擾：監測資料分散在不同單位、不同時間基準，轉動中無法即時判斷撐腳是否接觸；陣風突然加大時繼續轉動，結構傾斜、撐腳衝擊滑道，造成滑道損壞或懸臂端劇烈晃動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Monitoring scattered across teams on different time bases cannot tell in real time whether a leg is touching; continuing to turn as gusts rise lets the structure tilt and legs strike the slideway, damaging it or making the tips sway violently. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"轉動前確認氣象預報與現場風速計運作，訂定轉動上限風速；轉動中由監測中心整合全站儀、間隙感測器、千斤頂壓力與應變資料即時顯示，任一項達警戒值即減速，達停止值即停機鎖定，所有資料以同一時間基準保存。","textEn":"Before rotation confirm the forecast and that site anemometers work, and set a maximum wind speed; during rotation a monitoring centre combines total-station, gap-sensor, jack-pressure and strain data in real time, slowing at any alert value and stopping and locking at any stop value, with all data stored on a common time base.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"轉動作業前召開停留點會議，確認監測項目、警戒與停止值、通訊方式、風速限制與緊急鎖定程序；總指揮、設計代表、監造與鐵路或航道主管機關代表均需在場。","textEn":"Hold a hold-point meeting before rotation to confirm monitored items, alert and stop values, communications, wind limit and emergency locking; the rotation director, design representative, supervising engineer and the railway or waterway authority representative must all be present.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉動過程監測與停機條件」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","轉動前確認氣象預報與現場風速計運作，訂定轉動上限風速。","牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Before rotation confirm the forecast and that site anemometers work, and set a maximum wind speed.","Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control."],"answer":1,"explanation":"轉動前確認氣象預報與現場風速計運作，訂定轉動上限風速；轉動中由監測中心整合全站儀、間隙感測器、千斤頂壓力與應變資料即時顯示，任一項達警戒值即減速，達停止值即停機鎖定，所有資料以同一時間基準保存。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before rotation confirm the forecast and that site anemometers work, and set a maximum wind speed; during rotation a monitoring centre combines total-station, gap-sensor, jack-pressure and strain data in real time, slowing at any alert value and stopping and locking at any stop value, with all data stored on a common time base. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b041-v13-32","title":"轉動過程監測與停機條件：失效診斷","titleEn":"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉動中監測與風速限制」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Monitoring and wind limits during rotation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"監測資料分散在不同單位、不同時間基準，轉動中無法即時判斷撐腳是否接觸；陣風突然加大時繼續轉動，結構傾斜、撐腳衝擊滑道，造成滑道損壞或懸臂端劇烈晃動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Monitoring scattered across teams on different time bases cannot tell in real time whether a leg is touching; continuing to turn as gusts rise lets the structure tilt and legs strike the slideway, damaging it or making the tips sway violently. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：每一項都必須事先設定警戒值與停止值。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Every quantity needs alert and stop values set in advance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「轉動只需要量轉角，到位後再量高程即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Only the rotation angle needs measuring during the turn; levels can be checked on arrival.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"監測資料分散在不同單位、不同時間基準，轉動中無法即時判斷撐腳是否接觸；陣風突然加大時繼續轉動，結構傾斜、撐腳衝擊滑道，造成滑道損壞或懸臂端劇烈晃動。","textEn":"Monitoring scattered across teams on different time bases cannot tell in real time whether a leg is touching; continuing to turn as gusts rise lets the structure tilt and legs strike the slideway, damaging it or making the tips sway violently.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉動過程監測與停機條件」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Monitoring and stop criteria during rotation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。","監測資料分散在不同單位、不同時間基準，轉動中無法即時判斷撐腳是否接觸；陣風突然加大時繼續轉動，結構傾斜、撐腳衝擊滑道，造成滑道損壞或懸臂端劇烈晃動。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.","Monitoring scattered across teams on different time bases cannot tell in real time whether a leg is touching."],"answer":2,"explanation":"監測資料分散在不同單位、不同時間基準，轉動中無法即時判斷撐腳是否接觸；陣風突然加大時繼續轉動，結構傾斜、撐腳衝擊滑道，造成滑道損壞或懸臂端劇烈晃動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Monitoring scattered across teams on different time bases cannot tell in real time whether a leg is touching; continuing to turn as gusts rise lets the structure tilt and legs strike the slideway, damaging it or making the tips sway violently. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b041-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷」與「跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"System change after fixing and long-term settlement\" and \"Clearance budget over a live line and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b041-v13-33","title":"封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"System change after fixing and long-term settlement: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「封固後承台沉陷」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pile-cap settlement after fixing” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"轉體期間全部重量集中在球鉸，再由下轉盤擴散到承台與樁基；封鉸後球鉸、撐腳與封固混凝土共同成為墩底，結構體系由單點支承轉為固結。接著與相鄰跨合龍，懸臂成為連續梁的一部分，潛變使內力逐漸重分配。因為整座 T 構只坐在一個承台上，承台的不均勻沉陷會直接轉為懸臂端的高程變化；跨越鐵路時，這個變化還關係到下方淨空與相鄰跨的接縫。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「封固後承台沉陷」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"During rotation all the weight passes through the hinge and spreads through the lower turntable into the pile cap and piles; after encasement the hinge, legs and encasement concrete together form the pier base and the system changes from a single-point support to a fixed base. Closure with adjacent spans then makes the cantilevers part of a continuous girder, and creep gradually redistributes forces. Because the whole T-frame stands on one pile cap, differential settlement of that cap translates directly into tip-level changes, which over a railway also affect the clearance below and the joints with adjacent spans. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pile-cap settlement after fixing” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：承台寬 10 m，兩側樁群差異沉陷 Δs = 5 mm：承台傾角 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad，傳到 60 m 懸臂端的高程變化約 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm，足以影響閉合段高程與相鄰伸縮縫。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a 10 m wide pile cap with Δs = 5 mm differential settlement between pile groups, the cap tilts 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad, changing the 60 m tip level by about 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm, enough to affect the closure level and the adjacent expansion joint.","failure":"常見誤解：「封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「封固後承台沉陷」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pile-cap settlement after fixing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-33-k1","title":"封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷","titleEn":"System change after fixing and long-term settlement","text":"轉體期間全部重量集中在球鉸，再由下轉盤擴散到承台與樁基；封鉸後球鉸、撐腳與封固混凝土共同成為墩底，結構體系由單點支承轉為固結。接著與相鄰跨合龍，懸臂成為連續梁的一部分，潛變使內力逐漸重分配。","textEn":"During rotation all the weight passes through the hinge and spreads through the lower turntable into the pile cap and piles; after encasement the hinge, legs and encasement concrete together form the pier base and the system changes from a single-point support to a fixed base. Closure with adjacent spans then makes the cantilevers part of a continuous girder, and creep gradually redistributes forces.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System change after fixing and long-term settlement\" is correct?","options":["轉體期間全部重量集中在球鉸，再由下轉盤擴散到承台與樁基；封鉸後球鉸、撐腳與封固混凝土共同成為墩底，結構體系由單點支承轉為固結。","封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。","跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。"],"optionsEn":["During rotation all the weight passes through the hinge and spreads through the lower turntable into the pile cap and piles.","Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.","Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"轉體期間全部重量集中在球鉸，再由下轉盤擴散到承台與樁基；封鉸後球鉸、撐腳與封固混凝土共同成為墩底，結構體系由單點支承轉為固結。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"During rotation all the weight passes through the hinge and spreads through the lower turntable into the pile cap and piles; after encasement the hinge, legs and encasement concrete together form the pier base and the system changes from a single-point support to a fixed base. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b041-v13-34","title":"封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷：定量估算","titleEn":"System change after fixing and long-term settlement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「封固後承台沉陷」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pile-cap settlement after fixing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：承台寬 10 m，兩側樁群差異沉陷 Δs = 5 mm：承台傾角 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad，傳到 60 m 懸臂端的高程變化約 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm，足以影響閉合段高程與相鄰伸縮縫。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a 10 m wide pile cap with Δs = 5 mm differential settlement between pile groups, the cap tilts 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad, changing the 60 m tip level by about 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm, enough to affect the closure level and the adjacent expansion joint. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在承台四角與兩懸臂端設永久沉陷與高程觀測點，於轉動前、轉動後、封鉸後、合龍後及通車後定期量測，與預測沉陷曲線比較；封鉸混凝土定期檢查裂縫，並確認排水孔暢通，避免積水進入球鉸區。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Set permanent settlement and level points at the four cap corners and both tips, survey them before and after rotation, after encasement, after closure and periodically after opening, and compare with the predicted settlement curve; inspect the encasement concrete for cracks and keep drains clear so water does not reach the hinge zone.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"承台寬 10 m，兩側樁群差異沉陷 Δs = 5 mm：承台傾角 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad，傳到 60 m 懸臂端的高程變化約 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm，足以影響閉合段高程與相鄰伸縮縫。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"For a 10 m wide pile cap with Δs = 5 mm differential settlement between pile groups, the cap tilts 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad, changing the 60 m tip level by about 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm, enough to affect the closure level and the adjacent expansion joint. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System change after fixing and long-term settlement\", which statement holds?","options":["對稱設計的 T 構兩側重量必定相等，不需要配重。","承台寬 10 m，兩側樁群差異沉陷 Δs = 5 mm：承台傾角 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad，傳到 60 m 懸臂端的高程變化約 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm，足以影響閉合段高程與相鄰伸縮縫。","承台本來就很大，承受球鉸集中力不需要特別配筋。"],"optionsEn":["A symmetrically designed T-frame is always balanced and never needs ballast.","For a 10 m wide pile cap with Δs = 5 mm differential settlement between pile groups, the cap tilts 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad, changing the 60 m tip level by about 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm, enough to affect the closure level and the adjacent expansion joint.","A pile cap is so massive that it needs no special reinforcement for the hinge load."],"answer":1,"explanation":"承台寬 10 m，兩側樁群差異沉陷 Δs = 5 mm：承台傾角 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad，傳到 60 m 懸臂端的高程變化約 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm，足以影響閉合段高程與相鄰伸縮縫。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a 10 m wide pile cap with Δs = 5 mm differential settlement between pile groups, the cap tilts 0.005/10 = 0.0005 rad, changing the 60 m tip level by about 0.0005×60 = 0.030 m = 30 mm, enough to affect the closure level and the adjacent expansion joint. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b041-v13-35","title":"封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"System change after fixing and long-term settlement: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「封固後承台沉陷」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pile-cap settlement after fixing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在承台四角與兩懸臂端設永久沉陷與高程觀測點，於轉動前、轉動後、封鉸後、合龍後及通車後定期量測，與預測沉陷曲線比較；封鉸混凝土定期檢查裂縫，並確認排水孔暢通，避免積水進入球鉸區。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Set permanent settlement and level points at the four cap corners and both tips, survey them before and after rotation, after encasement, after closure and periodically after opening, and compare with the predicted settlement curve; inspect the encasement concrete for cracks and keep drains clear so water does not reach the hinge zone. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：承台與樁基設計須以轉體期間的單點集中荷載與封固後的長期荷載兩種狀態檢核，並在交接文件中保留沉陷觀測歷程與預測曲線；任何鄰近開挖或降水工程須通知橋梁管理單位評估。","observationEn":"Site practice: Pile cap and pile design must be checked for both the single-point load during rotation and the long-term load after fixing, with the settlement history and predicted curve kept in the handover file; any nearby excavation or dewatering must be notified to the bridge owner for assessment.","failure":"注意干擾：若只在轉動前後量測，忽略封鉸與合龍後的長期沉陷，數年後懸臂端下沉、伸縮縫錯台，跨鐵路段淨空逐漸減少；封鉸混凝土與既有轉盤之間若形成冷縫且未處理，雨水滲入使球鉸鋼板與錨筋腐蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Surveying only around the rotation and ignoring long-term settlement after encasement and closure lets the tips drop and joints step over the years while clearance over the railway shrinks; an untreated cold joint between encasement and turntable lets rainwater reach the hinge plates and anchors, corroding them. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在承台四角與兩懸臂端設永久沉陷與高程觀測點，於轉動前、轉動後、封鉸後、合龍後及通車後定期量測，與預測沉陷曲線比較；封鉸混凝土定期檢查裂縫，並確認排水孔暢通，避免積水進入球鉸區。","textEn":"Set permanent settlement and level points at the four cap corners and both tips, survey them before and after rotation, after encasement, after closure and periodically after opening, and compare with the predicted settlement curve; inspect the encasement concrete for cracks and keep drains clear so water does not reach the hinge zone.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"承台與樁基設計須以轉體期間的單點集中荷載與封固後的長期荷載兩種狀態檢核，並在交接文件中保留沉陷觀測歷程與預測曲線；任何鄰近開挖或降水工程須通知橋梁管理單位評估。","textEn":"Pile cap and pile design must be checked for both the single-point load during rotation and the long-term load after fixing, with the settlement history and predicted curve kept in the handover file; any nearby excavation or dewatering must be notified to the bridge owner for assessment.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System change after fixing and long-term settlement\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","萬噸級結構轉動時慣性很大，到位時一定需要很大的制動力。","在承台四角與兩懸臂端設永久沉陷與高程觀測點，於轉動前、轉動後、封鉸後、合龍後及通車後定期量測，與預測沉陷曲線比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A structure of tens of thousands of tonnes has huge rotational inertia and needs a huge braking force at arrival.","Set permanent settlement and level points at the four cap corners and both tips, survey them before and after rotation, after encasement, after closure and periodically after opening, and compare with the predicted settlement curve."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在承台四角與兩懸臂端設永久沉陷與高程觀測點，於轉動前、轉動後、封鉸後、合龍後及通車後定期量測，與預測沉陷曲線比較；封鉸混凝土定期檢查裂縫，並確認排水孔暢通，避免積水進入球鉸區。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Set permanent settlement and level points at the four cap corners and both tips, survey them before and after rotation, after encasement, after closure and periodically after opening, and compare with the predicted settlement curve; inspect the encasement concrete for cracks and keep drains clear so water does not reach the hinge zone. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b041-v13-36","title":"封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷：失效診斷","titleEn":"System change after fixing and long-term settlement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「封固後承台沉陷」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pile-cap settlement after fixing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若只在轉動前後量測，忽略封鉸與合龍後的長期沉陷，數年後懸臂端下沉、伸縮縫錯台，跨鐵路段淨空逐漸減少；封鉸混凝土與既有轉盤之間若形成冷縫且未處理，雨水滲入使球鉸鋼板與錨筋腐蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Surveying only around the rotation and ignoring long-term settlement after encasement and closure lets the tips drop and joints step over the years while clearance over the railway shrinks; an untreated cold joint between encasement and turntable lets rainwater reach the hinge plates and anchors, corroding them. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因為整座 T 構只坐在一個承台上，承台的不均勻沉陷會直接轉為懸臂端的高程變化；跨越鐵路時，這個變化還關係到下方淨空與相鄰跨的接縫。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because the whole T-frame stands on one pile cap, differential settlement of that cap translates directly into tip-level changes, which over a railway also affect the clearance below and the joints with adjacent spans.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「封鉸後球鉸就失去作用，之後的沉陷與耐久與轉體無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once encased, the hinge plays no further role, so later settlement and durability have nothing to do with the rotation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只在轉動前後量測，忽略封鉸與合龍後的長期沉陷，數年後懸臂端下沉、伸縮縫錯台，跨鐵路段淨空逐漸減少；封鉸混凝土與既有轉盤之間若形成冷縫且未處理，雨水滲入使球鉸鋼板與錨筋腐蝕。","textEn":"Surveying only around the rotation and ignoring long-term settlement after encasement and closure lets the tips drop and joints step over the years while clearance over the railway shrinks; an untreated cold joint between encasement and turntable lets rainwater reach the hinge plates and anchors, corroding them.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「封固後的體系轉換與長期沉陷」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System change after fixing and long-term settlement\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若只在轉動前後量測，忽略封鉸與合龍後的長期沉陷，數年後懸臂端下沉、伸縮縫錯台，跨鐵路段淨空逐漸減少。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。"],"optionsEn":["Surveying only around the rotation and ignoring long-term settlement after encasement and closure lets the tips drop and joints step over the years while clearance over the railway shrinks.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若只在轉動前後量測，忽略封鉸與合龍後的長期沉陷，數年後懸臂端下沉、伸縮縫錯台，跨鐵路段淨空逐漸減少；封鉸混凝土與既有轉盤之間若形成冷縫且未處理，雨水滲入使球鉸鋼板與錨筋腐蝕。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Surveying only around the rotation and ignoring long-term settlement after encasement and closure lets the tips drop and joints step over the years while clearance over the railway shrinks; an untreated cold joint between encasement and turntable lets rainwater reach the hinge plates and anchors, corroding them. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b041-v13-37","title":"跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Clearance budget over a live line and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「跨鐵路淨空預算」如何影響橋梁轉體施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Clearance budget over the railway” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge rotation construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"轉體橋多半跨越營運中的鐵路或道路，完工後下方仍有列車與電車線，所以梁底淨空不能只在完工當天符合，而要在整個使用年限內符合：潛變下垂、承台沉陷、未來鋪面加鋪與鐵路軌道抬升都會吃掉淨空。交接時必須把這些因素做成淨空預算，並說明實測基準；同時把轉體期間的全部紀錄（稱重、試轉、轉動監測、封鉸）整理為工程檔案，因為日後的任何評估都需要知道這座橋曾經承受過的特殊臨時狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「跨鐵路淨空預算」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Rotated bridges usually cross live railways or roads, so trains and catenary remain below after completion, and soffit clearance must hold not just on opening day but throughout the service life: creep sag, pile-cap settlement, future resurfacing and track lifting all consume clearance. Handover must therefore present a clearance budget with measured baselines, and compile every rotation record, from weighing, trial turn and rotation monitoring to encasement, into the engineering file, because any later assessment needs to know the unusual temporary states the bridge has experienced. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Clearance budget over the railway” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：懸臂端彈性撓度 25 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時潛變下垂 25×2.0 = 50 mm；完工實測淨空 7.25 m，扣除 0.05 m 後為 7.20 m，若鐵路要求最小 7.00 m，尚餘 0.20 m 供沉陷與軌道抬升使用。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a 25 mm elastic tip deflection and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep sag is 25×2.0 = 50 mm; an as-built clearance of 7.25 m becomes 7.20 m, and against a railway minimum of 7.00 m, 0.20 m remains for settlement and future track lifting.","failure":"常見誤解：「跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「跨鐵路淨空預算」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Clearance budget over the railway”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-37-k1","title":"跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接","titleEn":"Clearance budget over a live line and handover","text":"轉體橋多半跨越營運中的鐵路或道路，完工後下方仍有列車與電車線，所以梁底淨空不能只在完工當天符合，而要在整個使用年限內符合：潛變下垂、承台沉陷、未來鋪面加鋪與鐵路軌道抬升都會吃掉淨空。交接時必須把這些因素做成淨空預算，並說明實測基準；同時把轉體期間的全部紀錄（稱重、試轉、轉動監測、封鉸）整理為工程檔案，因為日後的任何評估都需要知道這座橋曾經承受過的特殊臨時狀態。","textEn":"Rotated bridges usually cross live railways or roads, so trains and catenary remain below after completion, and soffit clearance must hold not just on opening day but throughout the service life: creep sag, pile-cap settlement, future resurfacing and track lifting all consume clearance. Handover must therefore present a clearance budget with measured baselines, and compile every rotation record, from weighing, trial turn and rotation monitoring to encasement, into the engineering file, because any later assessment needs to know the unusual temporary states the bridge has experienced.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Clearance budget over a live line and handover\" is correct?","options":["跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。","轉體橋多半跨越營運中的鐵路或道路，完工後下方仍有列車與電車線，所以梁底淨空不能只在完工當天符合，而要在整個使用年限內符合：潛變下垂、承台沉陷、未來鋪面加鋪與鐵路軌道抬升都會吃掉淨空。","轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion.","Rotated bridges usually cross live railways or roads, so trains and catenary remain below after completion, and soffit clearance must hold not just on opening day but throughout the service life: creep sag, pile-cap settlement, future resurfacing and track lifting all consume clearance.","Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction."],"answer":1,"explanation":"轉體橋多半跨越營運中的鐵路或道路，完工後下方仍有列車與電車線，所以梁底淨空不能只在完工當天符合，而要在整個使用年限內符合：潛變下垂、承台沉陷、未來鋪面加鋪與鐵路軌道抬升都會吃掉淨空。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Rotated bridges usually cross live railways or roads, so trains and catenary remain below after completion, and soffit clearance must hold not just on opening day but throughout the service life: creep sag, pile-cap settlement, future resurfacing and track lifting all consume clearance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b041-v13-38","title":"跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Clearance budget over a live line and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「跨鐵路淨空預算」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Clearance budget over the railway” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：懸臂端彈性撓度 25 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時潛變下垂 25×2.0 = 50 mm；完工實測淨空 7.25 m，扣除 0.05 m 後為 7.20 m，若鐵路要求最小 7.00 m，尚餘 0.20 m 供沉陷與軌道抬升使用。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a 25 mm elastic tip deflection and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep sag is 25×2.0 = 50 mm; an as-built clearance of 7.25 m becomes 7.20 m, and against a railway minimum of 7.00 m, 0.20 m remains for settlement and future track lifting. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：通車前與鐵路主管機關共同量測梁底至軌面的淨空並簽認，作為基準；之後在定期檢查中以相同測點與方法重測，扣除溫度影響後比較趨勢，接近預算下限時提早規劃處置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before opening, measure soffit-to-rail clearance jointly with the railway authority and sign it as the baseline; at routine inspections re-measure at the same points by the same method, correct for temperature, compare the trend and plan remedies early if the budget's lower limit approaches.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"懸臂端彈性撓度 25 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時潛變下垂 25×2.0 = 50 mm；完工實測淨空 7.25 m，扣除 0.05 m 後為 7.20 m，若鐵路要求最小 7.00 m，尚餘 0.20 m 供沉陷與軌道抬升使用。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With a 25 mm elastic tip deflection and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep sag is 25×2.0 = 50 mm; an as-built clearance of 7.25 m becomes 7.20 m, and against a railway minimum of 7.00 m, 0.20 m remains for settlement and future track lifting. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Clearance budget over a live line and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["球鉸做得越大越安全，轉動也會越省力。","牽引力只要大於轉動阻力即可，千斤頂越大越好控制。","懸臂端彈性撓度 25 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時潛變下垂 25×2.0 = 50 mm。"],"optionsEn":["A bigger spherical hinge is always safer and also easier to turn.","Traction only needs to exceed resistance, and bigger jacks are always easier to control.","With a 25 mm elastic tip deflection and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep sag is 25×2.0 = 50 mm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"懸臂端彈性撓度 25 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時潛變下垂 25×2.0 = 50 mm；完工實測淨空 7.25 m，扣除 0.05 m 後為 7.20 m，若鐵路要求最小 7.00 m，尚餘 0.20 m 供沉陷與軌道抬升使用。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a 25 mm elastic tip deflection and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep sag is 25×2.0 = 50 mm; an as-built clearance of 7.25 m becomes 7.20 m, and against a railway minimum of 7.00 m, 0.20 m remains for settlement and future track lifting. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b041-v13-39","title":"跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Clearance budget over a live line and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨鐵路淨空預算」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Clearance budget over the railway” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"通車前與鐵路主管機關共同量測梁底至軌面的淨空並簽認，作為基準；之後在定期檢查中以相同測點與方法重測，扣除溫度影響後比較趨勢，接近預算下限時提早規劃處置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before opening, measure soffit-to-rail clearance jointly with the railway authority and sign it as the baseline; at routine inspections re-measure at the same points by the same method, correct for temperature, compare the trend and plan remedies early if the budget's lower limit approaches. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件應包含轉體全過程紀錄、球鉸與封鉸細部竣工圖、淨空預算與基準、沉陷觀測計畫，以及與鐵路或道路主管機關的介面聯絡窗口；檢查時進入鐵路範圍須依其安全規定申請封鎖時段。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover documents should contain the full rotation record, as-built hinge and encasement details, the clearance budget and baseline, the settlement monitoring plan and interface contacts with the railway or road authority; inspections inside the railway corridor must apply for possessions under its safety rules.","failure":"注意干擾：交接時沒有淨空預算與基準，多年後鐵路抬升軌道或加裝設備時才發現淨空不足，只能限制列車或緊急改善；轉體紀錄遺失則讓日後評估者無法判斷某些裂縫是否源自轉動期間的臨時受力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without a clearance budget and baseline at handover, insufficient clearance is discovered only years later when the railway lifts its track or adds equipment, forcing restrictions or urgent works; lost rotation records leave later assessors unable to tell whether certain cracks date from temporary forces during rotation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"通車前與鐵路主管機關共同量測梁底至軌面的淨空並簽認，作為基準；之後在定期檢查中以相同測點與方法重測，扣除溫度影響後比較趨勢，接近預算下限時提早規劃處置。","textEn":"Before opening, measure soffit-to-rail clearance jointly with the railway authority and sign it as the baseline; at routine inspections re-measure at the same points by the same method, correct for temperature, compare the trend and plan remedies early if the budget's lower limit approaches.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件應包含轉體全過程紀錄、球鉸與封鉸細部竣工圖、淨空預算與基準、沉陷觀測計畫，以及與鐵路或道路主管機關的介面聯絡窗口；檢查時進入鐵路範圍須依其安全規定申請封鎖時段。","textEn":"Handover documents should contain the full rotation record, as-built hinge and encasement details, the clearance budget and baseline, the settlement monitoring plan and interface contacts with the railway or road authority; inspections inside the railway corridor must apply for possessions under its safety rules.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Clearance budget over a live line and handover\"?","options":["通車前與鐵路主管機關共同量測梁底至軌面的淨空並簽認，作為基準；之後在定期檢查中以相同測點與方法重測，扣除溫度影響後比較趨勢，接近預算下限時提早規劃處置。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","球鉸摩擦係數可以直接採用材料型錄值，不必現場試驗。"],"optionsEn":["Before opening, measure soffit-to-rail clearance jointly with the railway authority and sign it as the baseline.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The hinge friction coefficient can be taken from the catalogue without site testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"通車前與鐵路主管機關共同量測梁底至軌面的淨空並簽認，作為基準；之後在定期檢查中以相同測點與方法重測，扣除溫度影響後比較趨勢，接近預算下限時提早規劃處置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before opening, measure soffit-to-rail clearance jointly with the railway authority and sign it as the baseline; at routine inspections re-measure at the same points by the same method, correct for temperature, compare the trend and plan remedies early if the budget's lower limit approaches. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b041-v13-40","title":"跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Clearance budget over a live line and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"prerequisiteIds":["b041-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「跨鐵路淨空預算」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Clearance budget over the railway” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"交接時沒有淨空預算與基準，多年後鐵路抬升軌道或加裝設備時才發現淨空不足，只能限制列車或緊急改善；轉體紀錄遺失則讓日後評估者無法判斷某些裂縫是否源自轉動期間的臨時受力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without a clearance budget and baseline at handover, insufficient clearance is discovered only years later when the railway lifts its track or adds equipment, forcing restrictions or urgent works; lost rotation records leave later assessors unable to tell whether certain cracks date from temporary forces during rotation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：交接時必須把這些因素做成淨空預算，並說明實測基準；同時把轉體期間的全部紀錄（稱重、試轉、轉動監測、封鉸）整理為工程檔案，因為日後的任何評估都需要知道這座橋曾經承受過的特殊臨時狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handover must therefore present a clearance budget with measured baselines, and compile every rotation record, from weighing, trial turn and rotation monitoring to encasement, into the engineering file, because any later assessment needs to know the unusual temporary states the bridge has experienced.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「跨鐵路的梁底淨空只要在完工驗收時合格即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Soffit clearance over a railway only has to pass at completion.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b041-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"交接時沒有淨空預算與基準，多年後鐵路抬升軌道或加裝設備時才發現淨空不足，只能限制列車或緊急改善；轉體紀錄遺失則讓日後評估者無法判斷某些裂縫是否源自轉動期間的臨時受力。","textEn":"Without a clearance budget and baseline at handover, insufficient clearance is discovered only years later when the railway lifts its track or adds equipment, forcing restrictions or urgent works; lost rotation records leave later assessors unable to tell whether certain cracks date from temporary forces during rotation.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]},{"id":"b041-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「跨越營運線的淨空預算與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Clearance budget over a live line and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","交接時沒有淨空預算與基準，多年後鐵路抬升軌道或加裝設備時才發現淨空不足，只能限制列車或緊急改善。","轉體只是把橋轉個方向，結構受力與一般懸臂施工完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Without a clearance budget and baseline at handover, insufficient clearance is discovered only years later when the railway lifts its track or adds equipment, forcing restrictions or urgent works.","Rotation just turns the bridge, so its forces are identical to ordinary cantilever construction."],"answer":1,"explanation":"交接時沒有淨空預算與基準，多年後鐵路抬升軌道或加裝設備時才發現淨空不足，只能限制列車或緊急改善；轉體紀錄遺失則讓日後評估者無法判斷某些裂縫是否源自轉動期間的臨時受力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without a clearance budget and baseline at handover, insufficient clearance is discovered only years later when the railway lifts its track or adds equipment, forcing restrictions or urgent works; lost rotation records leave later assessors unable to tell whether certain cracks date from temporary forces during rotation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-abc-manual-2011","v13s-dlt-shibanpo-turning","v13s-structurae-ben-ahin","v13s-structurae-barqueta"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
